wei Vordertaschen und einer Ges&auml;&szlig;tasche. Inklusive Shorts.<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(429,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10002',10000,'Even softer feel. ','','World-wide tourer trials, the new Titleist Pro V1&reg; achieves exceptional distances, constant ball flight, a very soft feel, the proven drop-and-stop &trade; control on the green and longer durability. In the multi-component construction of the Pro V1&reg;, a softer ZG core with lower compression is used, which is surrounded by an ionomer shell which reacts sensitively to the impact. The high-performance Urethane / Elastomer &trade; shell in the spherical 352-Tetrahedron Dimple design has also undergone a further improvement and is particularly durable.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(430,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10002',20000,'Head Description','','Without exception the best golf ball, thanks to the redesigned 352-Tetrahedron Dimple design and the high-performance Urethane / Elastomer &trade; shell.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(431,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10003',10000,'Head Description','','High speed for extreme widths. For many different players.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(432,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10003',20000,'Maximum width at each stroke.','','This ball is particularly suitable for golfers who want to achieve first class long and high strokes at the fairway - and this every time. The launch technology core and the durable ionomer outer shell promote low spin and high ball speeds&nbsp;for extreme widths. For many different players.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(433,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10007',10000,'The softest distance ball on the market.','','The 2-Piece Wilson Staff DX2 Softball is the softest distance ball on the market with a 40 compression.\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Exceptional length and improved control due to less spin on the drive.</li>\r\n	<li>Smoother feel for better playability around and on the green.</li>\r\n	<li>Extremely soft ball, which has only half the compression as the average ball of leading brands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(434,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10008',10000,'Outstanding, constant performance!','','<ul>\r\n	<li>High-quality golf ball&nbsp;with high-performance core developed by Pinnacle,&nbsp;guranteed fast ball speed and maximum impacts each full stroke</li>\r\n	<li>Designed and manufactured in-house</li>\r\n	<li>The best quality golf balls in their category</li>\r\n	<li>Maximum width</li>\r\n	<li>High-energy core technology: low-compression core with fixed shell, creates explosive initial speed, very low spin, powerful, long flight paths and very wide distances</li>\r\n	<li>Core acts as a &quot;motor&quot;: the proprietary, high-energy core guarantees super-fast ball speeds, helps the golfer to get a better width each stroke</li>\r\n	<li>Modern icosahedron dimple design with 332 dimples, creates a penetrating, direction-stable ball flight</li>\r\n	<li>Soft&nbsp;and&nbsp;durable ionomer shell, provides a super-comfortable feel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(436,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10009',20000,'Fly like a jet!','','The Royal Flush golf balls bring high ball speeds, enormous widths and a soft playing feeling.<br />\r\nThe core is 3% larger and has an improved energy transfer. A new Dimple configuration improves the aerodynamics and length.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrinted card patterns (spade, ace, check, heart) provide the optical highlight.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(437,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10010',10000,'Fly like a jet!','','The Callaway Warbird golf balls are perfect for extreme distances and a maximum ball flight. The&nbsp;two-piece ball has a larger, softer and highly elastic core. The thinner surface reinforces the feeling without making concessions at speed and width during the tee. The surface pattern has been&nbsp;increased and now offers better drainage properties, for greater widths at low speeds. At the same time, the stable and penetrating ball flight is the&nbsp;trademark of HEX aerodynamics.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(438,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10013',10000,'Excellent width with easy handling!','','Easy to play 2-Piece Golfball from Wilson with a very good width and easy handling.<br />\r\nPacked with 24 balls. The Ultra Distance Ball offers excellent price / performance.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(439,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10010',20000,'Head Description','','Perfect for extreme distances and maximum ball flight. The&nbsp;two-piece ball has a larger, softer and highly elastic core.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(440,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10018',10000,'Head Description','','The new Dri LITE Prime Deluxe Golf Cartbag! The new model of the water-repellent series of Big Max provides best processing from selected premium materials.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(441,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10018',20000,'Desrciption','','The new Dri LITE Prime is the ultimate Deluxe Golf Cart Bag.<br />\r\nThe new model of the water-repellent series of Big Max provides best processing from selected premium materials. Compared to standard golf bags, the Dri Lite technology keeps your bag dry longer. All Dri LITE Bags are water repellent and offer extra protection on wet days.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n14-compartment organizer top<br />\r\nwater-repellent<br />\r\nputter case<br />\r\nbattery<br />\r\nlarge freezer<br />\r\ntowel rail<br />\r\numbrella holder<br />\r\ntransport handles<br />\r\n9 water-repellent pockets<br />\r\n2 netting pockets<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUltralight: 2.9 kg (6.4 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(442,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10019',10000,'Head Description','','The 100% waterproof golf bag! A few rounds of golf on the course are no longer a problem, no matter what weather! Made for wet days on the golf course.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(443,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10019',20000,'Description','','The BIG MAX Aqua Silencio is made of 100% waterproof materials. The patented waterproof seams and zippers keep your gear dry. A few rounds of golf on the course are no longer a problem, no matter what weather! Made for wet days on the golf course.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBIG MAX 14-way SIlent Organizer Top - 9.5 inches<br />\r\nindividual compartments for every racket<br />\r\n100% waterproof, sealed seams<br />\r\nXL Cooling bag<br />\r\numbrella holder<br />\r\nglove Holder<br />\r\ntowel rail<br />\r\nscore card pocket<br />\r\nstrap Fix<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 4 kg (8.8 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(444,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10021',10000,'Head Description','','One of the most popular bags goes into the second round! Protect your rackets and avoid being distracted by annoying chattering.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(445,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10021',20000,'Description','','<div>One of the most popular bags goes into the 2nd round.<br />\r\nThe usual practical and innovative Cartbag makes its name all honor. Due to the special 14-way divider, each individual racket has its own place. Thus, the shaft of the bats is spared and the annoying sound of batsheads which beat together belongs to the past. The new organizer also offers enough space for oversize putter handles. In addition, the Silencio Organizer Cartbag has all the proven features of BIG MAX,&nbsp;e.g. the large refrigerator compartment, the integrated rain cover or the practical umbrella holder. Protect your rackets and avoid being distracted by annoying chattering.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Big Max Silencio 2 Golfbag offers:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n14-fold Silent Organizer<br />\r\nsingle compartment for each rack<br />\r\nwaterproof<br />\r\nXL refrigerator compartment<br />\r\nintegrated rain cover<br />\r\ntee holder<br />\r\npencil holder<br />\r\ncase&nbsp;for sunglasses or smartphone<br />\r\nintegrated umbrella holder<br />\r\nputter cover<br />\r\ngloves rail<br />\r\ntowel rail<br />\r\nscorecard bracket<br />\r\nhandle<br />\r\nstrap fix<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 4.4 kg (9.7 pounds)</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(446,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10025',10000,'Head Description','','The new water resistant Dri Lite Cartbag by Big Max! Modern color combinations, coupled with the practical Big Max features, should immediately convince every golfer of this lightweight.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(447,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10025',20000,'Description','','The new waterproof Dri Lite Cartbag from Big Max sets new standards in the golf industry. The patented, waterproof zippers on each pocket and the waterproof fabric keep your gear dry during play. Modern color combinations&nbsp;coupled with the practical Big Max features should immediately convince every golfer of this lightweight.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n14 way organizer top<br />\r\nwaterproof valuables pockets<br />\r\n9 large pack pockets<br />\r\npatented waterproof zippers on all pockets<br />\r\ncool bag<br />\r\ntea &amp; pencil age<br />\r\nscorecardholder<br />\r\numbrella holder<br />\r\ngloves holder<br />\r\ngolf towel holder<br />\r\nmany practical Big Max features<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 2.35 kg (5.2 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(448,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10032',10000,'Head Description','','The 100% waterproof Cartbag! The Cartbag offers a great design and a lot of space for valuables and objects.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(449,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10032',20000,'Description','','Keep your rackets in place using the Bennington Lok Clip. Avoid&nbsp;chattering and slipping their bats through the unique 14-compartment clip-line technology from Bennington. The Cartbag offers a great design and a lot of space for valuables and objects. The nylon fabric and the welded seams make the golf bag 100% waterproof.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNew organizer system:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClip Lok Technology<br />\r\n14 compartments Top with clip device (through divider)<br />\r\ntowel and umbrella<br />\r\nHeight: 24.1 cm (9.5 inches)<br />\r\nnylon fabric<br />\r\nanti-slip bottom<br />\r\nrain cover and carrying handle included<br />\r\