0000,'Description','','The Grip Lock Top keeps your rackets in position and prevents annoying chattering.<br />\r\n11 pockets with zipper and an insulated drink bag leave nothing to be desired.<br />\r\nIn addition, this bag features an external putter holder, drink holder and umbrella holder.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigh-tech nylon with padded shoulder straps for convenient transportation of your gear<br />\r\n14 way organizer top<br />\r\numbrella holder<br />\r\nisolated drink bag and holder<br />\r\nputter holder<br />\r\n9 Easy Access Bags',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(454,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10038',10000,'Head Description','','Water-repellent lightweight with plenty of storage space - keeps your gear dry even in bad weather.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(455,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10038',20000,'Description','','The Waterproof Cart Bag by TaylorMade has a 14-compartment divider with a size of 28 x 26 cm &nbsp;(11.03 inches&nbsp;x 10.24 inches). The 3 continuous compartments offer enough space for golf clubs. Made of waterproof material and with extra-welded, water-resistant zippers, the bag keeps your gear dry even in bad weather.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nwaterproof material<br />\r\n7 compartments for valuables and golf accessories<br />\r\npadded shoulder strap<br />\r\ntowel loop<br />\r\nrain hood<br />\r\nisolated drink compartment<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 2.4 kg (5.3 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(456,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10042',10000,'Head Desrciption','','Waterproof golf bag in sporty&nbsp;design like Carrybag&nbsp;- protects your equipment in all weather conditions and is even suitable as a Cartbag!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(457,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10042',20000,'Description','','Waterproof Sun Mountain Bag in light, classic-sporty design like Carrybag. High quality and water resistant YKK zippers plus extra taped seams protect your gear in all weather conditions. Optimal wearing comfort thanks to the EZ-Fit support system.<br />\r\nThe bag is also excellent as a Cartbag!<br />\r\n<br />\r\npatented 4-fold divider top 24.1 cm (9.49 inches)<br />\r\n100% waterproof - including rain cover<br />\r\ncomfortable handle for easy and comfortable lifting<br />\r\noptimal wearing comfort with EZ fit strap system for better balance and more ergonomic, back-protecting carrying of the bag<br />\r\nhigh resistance and stability<br />\r\ntowel, umbrella and pencil<br />\r\nsuede padded safety pocket<br />\r\nhigh quality stand made of high-strength aluminum - non-slip<br />\r\ntrolley suitable<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 2.25 kg (5 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(458,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10046',10000,'Head Description','','The Concourse combines trolley and bag in one. The innovative space miracle is also a perfect companion on air travel and fits in most trunks.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(459,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10046',20000,'Description','','The Concourse combines trolley and bag in one. The innovative space miracle is also a perfect companion on air travel and fits in most trunks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nquickclick folding device<br />\r\none-hand operation during set-up and dismounting<br />\r\nno bulky frame - fits perfectly to the golf bag<br />\r\nXL refrigerator compartment<br />\r\nbag for mobile phone and sunglasses<br />\r\nputter holder<br />\r\numbrella holder<br />\r\nhandle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeight: 2 kg (4.4 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(460,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10060',10000,'Head Description','','Stable and compact thanks to a new patented innovative design. Easily fold and transport the trolley!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(461,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10060',20000,'Description','','Patented INNOVATIVE design:<br />\r\nE-Z LATCH &trade; system simplifies the folding of the trolley and adjustment of the drawbar<br />\r\nextremely stable and easy-running 3-wheel trolley construction<br />\r\nhigh quality double front wheel design<br />\r\nwide wheelbase creates a sovereign stability on the pitch<br />\r\nergonomic and adjustable drawbar brings arms and shoulders to their natural position<br />\r\nhigh-tech construction and top design<br />\r\nsimple 3-step folding system with a maximum small pack size<br />\r\nheight-adjustable handle including handbrake<br />\r\ndjustable pocket holders without EXTRA need for straps<br />\r\nlightweight aluminum frame<br />\r\nsealed, ball-bearing precision wheels ensure extreme lightness and maintenance-free operation<br />\r\neasy with extremely high functional diversity<br />\r\nincl. screen and drink holders as well as scorecard holders<br />\r\n<br />\r\nmeasurements:&nbsp;38 cm x 63 cm (14.96 inches&nbsp;x&nbsp;24.80 inches)&nbsp;(folded)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(462,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10067',10000,'Head Description','','Continuously designed for distance and forgiveness.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(463,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10067',20000,'Description','','The new TaylorMade AeroBurner Driver is the fastest aerodynamic driver ever. He continues the successful Buner series from Taylormade. Thanks to the specially developed &quot;Aero Hosel&quot;, the&nbsp;racket weighs less than 300 grams (0.7 pounds), which leads to a higher&nbsp;racket head speed. The AeroBurner Driver is definitely suitable for players looking for distance and having fun at the tee-off. This can be from the professional to the newcomer. The&nbsp;racket also offers a significantly enlarged Sweetspot through the Speedpockets, for a high error forgiveness. This means that balls that are not&nbsp;hit in the center differ only slightly from the center of the beating bear upon&nbsp;spin, take-off angle and length.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(464,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10068',10000,'Head Description','','Fantastic versatility for precise strokes from any position thanks to a compact racket head shape, which at the same time conveys self-confidence in the response position.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(465,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10068',20000,'Description','','The <strong>TaylorMade M2 ​​Hybrid </strong>is characterized by a compact racket head shape, which provides additional self-confidence in the response position, so you can go unchecked to the tee. In addition, the optimized shape provides a fantastic versatility for precise and&nbsp;focused strokes from any position. The extremely lightweight construction of the TaylorMade M2 ​​Rescue&#39;s crown has been significantly economize on weight.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe low center of gravity affects the entire ball start and allows for high pitch angles and ideal spin rates for long straight strokes. The new Speed ​​Pocket design ensures optimal power transfer. This sets the entire face under tension and automatically increases the Sweetspot. The accumulated&nbsp;tension discharges itself at the moment of the hit in an explosive manner and transfers completely to the golf ball, regardless of the location of the&nbsp;large face you have hit. The result is a maximum ball speed and unattainable lengths. The TaylorMade M2 ​​Rescue is equipped with the Internal Acoustics Engineering System, which, together with the structured Hosel, provides improved vibration management, generates a rich sound and a fantastic playing feel.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(466,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10069',10000,'Head Description','','Start up, fly and land softly.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(467,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10069',20000,'Description','','The <strong>816 H1 by Titleist</strong> let the ball start, fly and land softly. The patented ARC springs actively in the moment for more speed, little spin and a lot of length! The ultra-bright face provides speed and length from its entire surface. Due to the high-MOI design, not even centered beats get more length.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor the 816 Hybrids, the leading edge and the edge of the Active Recoil Channel &trade; are slightly rounded. This allows the ball&nbsp; to slide more easily through the grass. 2-step loft selection and a new SureFit Tour &trade; loft and lie adjustment. This allows the 816 H1 to be perfectly matched to the game and close any length gap.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(468,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10070',10000,'Head Description','','The new racket has a peanut shape and is much smaller than the previous model (SLDR).',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(469,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10070',20000,'Description','','The <strong>Taylormade R15 Rescue </strong>has adapted itself to the wishes of the touring players with its club head shape and size. The smaller headboard allows a better playability of various balloons. Be it in the semi-rough, bunker or on slopes, you get a better ball contact. The&nbsp;emphasis is centered and neutral, which leads to a natural trajectory. At the Hosel, the loft (racket head angle) can be adjusted by a total of 3 degrees. The R15 Rescue is more suitable for better players who want to play the hybrid from difficult situations due to the shape and the neutral CG weight.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(470,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10071',10000,'Head Description','','It also enforces the correct leveling and saves the correct gameplay through regular training. Top for golfers every handicap!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(471,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10071',20000,'Description','','The <strong>Alien G-180 Degrees&nbsp;Wedges </strong>feature extremely easy handling and precise ball control. The integrated Gyroscopic Weight Ring technology consists of a rotating rotor inside the head of the beater, creating the forces and resistances that you feel as soon as the wedge leaves the swing of plane. It also enforces the correct leveling and saves the correct gameplay through regular training. Top for golfers every handicap!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(472,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10072',10000,'Head Description','','The &quot;VIQ CL&quot; series has been specially designed for ladies. Shafts and rackets are perfectly matched and optimized for golfers looking for performance and elegance without compromise.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(473,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10072',20000,'Description','','The &quot;VIQ CL&quot; series has been specially designed for ladies. Shafts and racquets are perfectly matched and optimized for golfers looking for performance and elegance without compromise.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe high-quality, technically innovative racket heads in ametyst have an insert made of damping material (Super Turbo Rubber) at the back of the sole, which counteracts vibrations and creates a pleasant sound in the hit moment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe developers of the &quot;Tourstage VIQ&quot; line used&nbsp;cleverly devised&nbsp;design ideas to help players achieve more consistent and successful strokes (Emotional Engineered Design).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn utility wood, the &quot;Neo Target Eye&quot; as an optical alignment aid on the racket directs the view to the center of gravity of the racket. The additionally V-shaped scorelines of the striking surface are carried as hologram into the beater crown. This has shown - as tests showed - a psychologically positive effect on the correct alignment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe special color profile on the shaft is also part of the &quot;Emotional Engineered Design&quot; of the &quot;Tourstage VIQ&quot; line. In addition to the optical effect, which makes the shaft shorter and more compact, Stable Swing Engineering convinces technically for a measurably higher impact resistance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe &quot;Tourstage VIQ CL&quot;-Utility-Woods present themselves visibly feminine, so three swarovski in the color of an ametyst are incorporated at the outer lower perimeter.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(474,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10073',10000,'Head Description','','Long&nbsp;hits and better playability\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Thin face - increases the pardon of error.</li>\r\n	<li>The distance that is achievable is thus increased particularly when the balls are not hit optimally.</li>\r\n	<li>Milling in the sole - provides more flexibility of the face and higher ball speeds.</li>\r\n	<li>A particularly low center of gravity allows lower lofts - the irons are therefore not more difficult to play but more length.</li>\r\n	<li>Damping element in the back of the racket - minimizes unwanted vibrations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(475,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10073',20000,'Description','','<strong>Product Information &quot;Taylor Made M2 Iron, Steel Shaft, Men&#39;s Right Hand&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTaylor Made M2 Iron, steel shaft, men&#39;s right hand</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nSingle-line and custom-made on request.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThin face - increases the ball speed even when the balls are not hit perfectly, for more pardon of error.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA milled in the sole - increases the flexibility of the face for more energy transfer to the ball.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOptimized weight distribution - low center of gravity facilitates ball start.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe low center of gravity made it possible to reduce the lofts of the iron somewhat - but with a lower center of gravity it was easy to play with more achievable width.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDamping of unwanted vibrations - is made possible by an element inserted on the back of the racquet head.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Shank: </strong>R-Flex and S-Flex: TaylorMade REAX 88HL<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Handle: </strong>TM Speed Gray End Cap (47 grams / 0.1 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(476,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10074',10000,'Head Description','','<em>Tomo Bystedt from TaylorMade says: &quot;All the know-how about Speed Pocket Technology&nbsp;sticks in the large&nbsp;face. The face slot technology provides more durability on the entire face. Golfers thus benefit from a stronger performance even in the event of a defeat. And the face slots are only available at the RSi.</em>',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(477,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10074',20000,'Description','','<strong>TaylorMade RSi 1 Iron Features</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nIron 3 to 8 with face slot technology<br />\r\n&bull; two slots close to heel and toe of the face for an even beat flexibility<br />\r\n&bull; no waste of the ball speed and more constant length in the case of non-centered impacts<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImproved Speed Pocket with ThruSlot Technology on irons 3 to 7<br />\r\n&bull; no&nbsp;waste of ball speed when hit under the center<br />\r\n&bull; higher pitch angle and more ball speed in all strokes<br />\r\n&bull; intelligent striking design: our thinnest striking surface with deep undercut and Inverted Cone Technology - for maximum impact speed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImproved sound and optimized feel thanks to innovative design and multiple damping systems.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<em>New Reax 90 steel shaft for optimum ball flight and ultimate length and performance.</em>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(478,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10076',10000,'Head Description','','The Callaway XR OS Irons are easier to hit, more&nbsp;pardon of error&nbsp;and longer, thanks to the industry-leading Cup 360 Technology and wider soles. They allow easy tee-offs for a ball flight, which leads to more space.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(479,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10076',20000,'Description','','<strong>Callaway XR OS Iron Properties</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Wide range with our leading edge in the industry</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nCallaway has made Cup-360 Technology even faster. Together with the multi-part construction Callaway has implemented a new heat treatment in the face, which provides more ball speed - with a gentle heat treatment on the body for better feeling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Easier to hit</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Callaway XR OS Irons with a weight center, which is lower and farther back, allow a simple stroke. This makes it easier for you to reach a ball flight, which leads to more space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Better pardon of error</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe wider soles increase the pardon of error, so you get more width with each stroke. You have more confidence in your ball feeling and have the technology to constantly make good strokes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Progressive lengths and lofts</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo allow you greater widths with every racket we have equipped the entire set with progressive lengths and lofts.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(480,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10078',10000,'Head Description','','An elegant one-line Iron pardon of error and suitable for beginners as well as advanced.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(481,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10078',20000,'Description','','The <strong>Titleist AP1 714 Irons </strong>are irresistible for demanding golfers who are looking for an irresistible tool to provide precise control over both the width and the direction of the strokes.<br />\r\nFor this purpose, Irons are pardon of error&nbsp;as has never been seen before at Titleist, and therefore also suitable for golfers with intermediate handicaps, while the AP2 Irons are suitable for particularly sporty players.<br />\r\nWhile the long Irons provide a low center of gravity for a high ball flight, the Irons provide the short strokes with a lower ball flight',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(482,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10079',10000,'Head Description','','Callaway Apex Utility Iron 2014: Performance, playability and&nbsp;pardon of error&nbsp;in a Utility Iron.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(483,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10079',20000,'Description','','Callaway Apex Utility Iron 2014 - Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Forged&nbsp;playing surface&nbsp;</strong>- The forged face allows for higher bale speeds across the entire surface to achieve the range players expect from these clubs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Sole weight </strong>- The sole weighting reduces the center of gravity, which improves the accuracy and the departure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Hollow body construction </strong>- The hollow body improves the error forgiveness in the conventional long iron mold. Golf players can perform every hit reliably.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(484,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10081',10000,'Head Description','','Pro Staff HDX Junior Complete Set by Wilson.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFairwaywood, Iron 7, PW, Putter, Bag',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(485,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10087',10000,'Head Description','','The Ping Scottsdale TR putter provides the grooves with a perfect hit.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(486,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10087',20000,'Description','','<strong>The Scottsdale TR &trade; Putter was named after the so-called &quot;True Roll&quot; </strong>the unadulterated rolling behavior, the result of innovative, new and differently deep grooves of PING.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe grooves are deepest in the middle, becoming flatter and more securely balanced ball speeds for outstanding wide control of putts that are centered, at the heel or at the tip.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLength-adjustable shafts lead to optimized performance. Seven models are available for all swing types.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>We offer the following models (length 34 inch, RH):</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR B60 Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Piper C Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Shea Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Shea H Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Tatum Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Tomcat S Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)<br />\r\nPing Scottsdale TR Anser T Putter for 105 Euro (SRP 169 Euro)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(487,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10095',10000,'Head Description','','A classic and timeless putter that delivers precise strokes. That Titanium alloy Pure Roll Insert delivers a crisp and clear feel in the hit moment.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(488,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10095',20000,'Description','','The persistent white finish of the Taylormade Ghost Toursputter prevents the player from being dazzled by the sun, while at the same time simplifying the aiming through the strong contrast with the grass.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Titallium-Alloy Pure Roll Insert provides a crisp and clear feeling in the hit moment. The ball leaves the striking surface smoothly and accurately. The variable weight at the bottom of the Taylormade Ghost Toursputter (except for the Taylormade Ghost Tour Corza Putter) allows the player to tailor the putter individually to their own stroke.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFurther product information<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSRP: 169.00 Euro<br />\r\nEAN code: 885583381452<br />\r\nLength: 35 inches',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(489,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10096',10000,'Head Description','','About two years long&nbsp;TaylorMade has continually worked on its Counterbalance Putter concept. A few months before the rule change, the <strong>Daddy Long Legs Plus </strong>puts a new heavyweight into the ring around <strong>the most&nbsp;pardon of error&nbsp;putter on the market</strong>.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(490,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10096',20000,'Description','','Specifications of the Putters Daddy Long Legs Plus by TaylorMade:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nfor right handers&nbsp;and left handers<br />\r\nBat head: High-MOI stainless steel (405 grams / 0.9 pounds)<br />\r\nInsert: 6061 aluminum<br />\r\nLoft: 2.5 degrees<br />\r\nShaft length: 34.5 inches, 36 inches<br />\r\nHandle: SuperStroke 2.0 Mid-Slim XL (198 grams / 0.44 pounds)<br />\r\nBalance: Face-Balanced<br />\r\nSRP: 279 Euro',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(491,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10097',10000,'Head Description','','Provides as much play support as possible for golf players! For beginners it is easier to hit the ball perfectly.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(492,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10097',20000,'Description','','The new <strong>Wilson Pro Staff </strong>golf clubs have been technically designed to provide a golfer with as much play support as possible. A deep cavity and a broad sole of iron provide for a very low center of gravity. This makes the ball easier to gain height and can be transported more easily on the fairway. The striking surfaces consistently offer a larger and more optimal hitting area. For beginners it is easier to hit the ball perfectly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Wilson Pro Staff 1/2 kit consists of the following items:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Iron 5, 7, 9 and SW:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n- standard length<br />\r\n- The extreme undercut cavity creates a very low center of gravity<br />\r\nto get the ball on the fairway.<br />\r\n- iron heads made of 431 precision stainless steel<br />\r\n- high quality graphite shaft<br />\r\n- robust and soft all-weather handles<br />\r\nprovide best grip with good feedback<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Fairwaywood # 3:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n- standard length<br />\r\n- high quality&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;head<br />\r\n- graphite shaft<br />\r\n- All weather grip provides best grip and feel in&nbsp;every weather.<br />\r\n- Weight distribution in the rear head section<br />\r\nfor a maximized ball flight and longer distances.<br />\r\n- including hood<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Putter:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n- classic putter<br />\r\n- oversize all-weather spitting handle<br />\r\n- high quality steel shaft<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStand Bag:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 10 x 7 Inch Top<br />\r\n- 7 times the bar<br />\r\n- Full Length Shaft Dividers (continuous shank separation for optimum protection)<br />\r\n- Large clothing bag over the entire length.<br />\r\n- 2 additional accessory pockets<br />\r\n- additional mesh pocket - For scorecard or other accessories<br />\r\n- large ball bag<br />\r\n- soft padded backpack carrying strap - distributes the weight optimally over both shoulders.<br />\r\n- stable standing mechanism<br />\r\n- umbrella holder (cord and eyelet)<br />\r\n- Matching rain cover / transport hood - with press button on the top to protect the top in the rain.<br />\r\n- Weight: 1,9 kg (4.2 pounds)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(493,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10098',10000,'Head Description','','The new <strong>Callaway XJ Hot Junior Golf Complete Set </strong>has been specially designed for children to give them the greatest possible playability with exceptional performance and fault tolerance ever offered by a junior beginner. The Callaway Junior Golf Set consists of 7&nbsp;golf clubs&nbsp;and a stylish carrying bag and is available for girls as well as boys. The 7&nbsp;golf clubs&nbsp;include a driver, fairway wood, hybrid, as well as 3 irons and a stylish putter from Odyssey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSupport!&nbsp;For beginners it is easier to hit the ball perfectly.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(494,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10098',20000,'Description','','<strong>Callaway XJ Hot Junior Complete Set:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe lofts in these Callaway complete sets are specially designed for children and have been chosen slightly higher, so that the golferian offspring get the balls easier in the air. The materials used in the XJ Hot Junior Golf Set have been designed to reduce the impact on children and not to overstress them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nColorfully, the XJ complete sets from Callaway were adjusted that girls get a&nbsp;purple design and boys get an&nbsp;orange&nbsp;design. The backpack carrying strap makes it easier for the kids to carry the bags and increases their mobility enormously.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe high-quality Odyssey Putter in the Callaway XJ Hot Junior golf set is the proven 2-ball model that is also familiar from the adult market and has already won numerous tournaments on the profit tour.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Details about the XJ Hot Junior Golf Set from Callaway:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdjusted Lofts: Lofts especially for children to get the balls in the air easily.<br />\r\n8 piece Set: The XJ Hot children&#39;s set consists of driver, fairway wood, hybrid, three irons, a putter and a bag. ,<br />\r\nDriver with 16 degrees&nbsp;loft and 360&nbsp;cubic meter&nbsp;volume for easy ball start.<br />\r\nFairway wood #3 with 24 degrees&nbsp;loft.<br />\r\nHybrid #5 with 30 degrees&nbsp;loft.<br />\r\nIron 7, 9, SW.<br />\r\nPutter in the 2 ball design.<br />\r\nCarriage with double strap and stand system.<br />\r\nColors: purple or orange.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(495,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10103',10000,'Head Description','','<ul>\r\n	<li>This complete set leaves no wish unfulfilled and offers the ideal entry into the golf sport.</li>\r\n	<li>Fairways 3 and 5 are ideally matched and have a pardon of error.</li>\r\n	<li>A hybrid five as a good friend for all difficult situations.</li>\r\n	<li>The iron 6-SW with graphite shaft with a low center of gravity for straight iron impacts.</li>\r\n	<li>Putter, carrybag and protective covers round off the perfectly matched package.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(496,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10103',20000,'Description','','<strong>The WILSON Womens Golf complete set at a glance</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nWilson&#39;s golf complete set is optimized for right handed women. Included in this set is a practical golf bag which the rackets and additional equipment are inside and can be placed like a water bottle. This golf bag in the modern green, gray and black color design convinces by its high wearing comfort. A complete set of golf clubs, which will be discussed in more detail later, completes the set and leaves nothing to be desired. The well-known manufacturer Wilson has put together a very good selection overall and makes a good figure as well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The golf complete set for Wilson women</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith the acquisition of this golf set the entry into the golf sport is secured. The included&nbsp;golf clubs&nbsp;puts optimally in the hand and allow a good feeling for the ball and the blow. In addition, different types of batters are available in Wilson&#39;s complete set so that different situations can be performed perfectly, from tee-off to punch-in. The rackets are all suitable for beginners and advanced, because they are designed for&nbsp;pardon of error&nbsp;and have a high moment of inertia. Especially the fairway woods are still reliable even in case of inaccurate strokes. The big heads also provide a good feel to the ball, so that a self-assured game can developed.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrade for women, this set is outstanding because the overall weight is quite low and the golf bag provides additional space for accessories such as a cooling bag for a beverage bottle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>The contents of the Wilson complete set for right handed women here once again in the overview:</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n14 piece complete set<br />\r\nweight in total about 4 kilograms (8.8 pounds)<br />\r\noptimized for ladies<br />\r\nsuitable for right handers<br />\r\nfairway wood size 3 and 5 including hoods<br />\r\nHybrid 5<br />\r\nPutter Blade<br />\r\n6-9 iron with graphite shaft<br />\r\nPitchingwedge<br />\r\nSandwedge<br />\r\nCarrybag with protection<br />\r\nIncludes space for further equipment and cooling bag for beverage bottle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>For whom is the Wilson complete set suitable?</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis complete set is an absolute recommendation to all who want to start worry-free with the golfing. For every situation on the green, this set is suitable, both the bridging of long distances and the tee-off in the sand are the right clubs. For women, this set of the high quality manufacturer Wilson is optimized because its low total weight of four kilograms is easy to transport. Also the rackets in the&nbsp;on-road test&nbsp;are almost perfectly in the hand and allow an impressive playing feeling and handling. The price / performance ratio is very good, the processing quality as well as the performance is right.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(497,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10104',10000,'Head Description','','In any weather on the safe side! The double layer TaylorMade screen in the special edition. On every green is a real eye-catcher!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(498,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10104',20000,'Description','','A real eye-catcher: The TaylorMade screen&nbsp;as a&nbsp;special edition! With this screen you are on the safe side in wind and weather. The double-layered umbrella is particularly robust, so that it does not fold over in strong winds. Printed with Star Wars lettering. The protective cover has a side zipper to pull it over the screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiameter of shield: 127 cm (50 inches)<br />\r\nDiameter handle: 3.5 cm (1.4 inches)<br />\r\nLength of shaft: 94 cm (37 inches)',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(499,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','DEU','B2C-10106',30000,'Toller schläger','','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(500,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10106',10000,'Head Description','','The beautiful Cobra King F6 Driver has many settings and is the racket for players looking for more length and consistency from the tea.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(501,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10106',20000,'Description','','The new King F6 has a weight in the sole, which can be moved between a front and a rear position. This allows you to choose a flatter more penetrating ball flight path or a higher flight path with more range.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe MyFly8 technology provides you with eight different settings of loft and ball trajectory and the SmartPad in the sole ensures that you have the rack always square regardless of the loft setting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe forged E9 Zoneface has a larger sweet zone for increased safety and range and the speed channel around the face provides a higher ball speed.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(502,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10106',30000,'','','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(503,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10110',10000,'Head Description','','Outstanding performance&nbsp;by every&nbsp;weather thanks to patented Opti-Feel leather with breathable double membrane.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(504,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10110',20000,'Description','','OPTI FEEL LEATHER<br />\r\nHigh-quality wearing comfort&nbsp;by every&nbsp;weather<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOPTIFLEX MATERIAL<br />\r\nOutstanding fit, support and flexibility<br />\r\n<br />\r\nX-TENSION<br />\r\nOutstanding performance: moisture-wicking, breathable and flexible<br />\r\n<br />\r\nADJUSTABLE OPTIFIT CLOSURE<br />\r\nThin, light and secure fit',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(505,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10111',10000,'Head Description','','Made from the finest cabaret leather with a flexible textile insert on the back of the hand, these gloves allow a great deal of grip, feel and durability. With ball marker.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(506,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10111',20000,'Description','','Made from the finest cabaret leather with a flexible textile insert on the back of the hand, these gloves allow a great deal of grip, feel and durability. With ball marker.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nsoft-standing cabretta with exclusive Tack-Tech technology for unsurpassed moisture resistance<br />\r\nDuPont Lycra net for optimum fit and breathability<br />\r\nwristbands for extra comfort<br />\r\n3M Scotchgard for consistent suppleness<br />\r\nnot twisting thumb',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(507,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10112',10000,'Head Description','','The 2 in 1 combination of rain cover and towel! Keeps bags and&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;dry at all times!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(508,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10112',20000,'Description','','Combined rain cover with hand towel<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExternal: 100% water-repellent nylon, keeps the rackets and the opening of the bag dry in the rain<br />\r\nInside: 100% cotton terry, to wipe and dry the golf clubs<br />\r\nSize: 20&quot; x 20&quot; (20 inches x 20 inches)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe integrated plastic clip is attached directly to the bag',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(509,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10113',10000,'Head Description','','The number 1 on the big profit tours. The name Seaforth stands for the most effective rain protection for all types of cart and tragebags.<br />\r\nSince 5 Ryder Cups 97% of all tourists have been using Seaforth - the exclusive partner for rain protection.<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(510,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10113',20000,'Description','','The rainy weather unfortunately does not usually end. We carry the number 1 under the rain hoods on the big profit trips. The name Seaforth stands for the most effective rain protection for all types of cart and tragebags.&nbsp;Since 5 Ryder Cubs 97% of all tourists have&nbsp;been using Seaforth - the&nbsp;exclusive partner for rain protection!&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe Seaforth Slicker provides ultimate protection for your rackets and your bag. With the patented technology the Seaforth Slicker is a rain cover that protects the entire bag.<br />\r\nThe slicker can be split to the full length so you can wrap the cover around your bag in the rain - fast and easy! A combination of elastic cords and velcro fastenings guarantee a firm fit on almost every golf bag. You can also use the carrying straps of your bag by pulling it through the T-shaped opening on the back of the slicker. For a cart or touring bag simply close the &quot;T&quot;. The slicker also fits easily on standbags - simply attach the Velcro fasteners around the stand of the bag and then close the bottom of the slicker and your standbag is also protected from rain or wind.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Slicker can be easily rolled up and stored in the golf bag thanks to the extremely flexible and light fabrication - and needs just as much space as a conventional rain cover. The name Seaforth stands for the most effective rain protection for all types of cart and tragebags.<br />\r\nThe practical Velcro fasteners allow access to the side pockets of the golf bag from 2 sides.<br />\r\nThe special construction of the hood allows uncomplicated access to all golf clubs in the bag.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(511,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10114',10000,'Head Description','','The Nike Windshield VII in sporty design is the ideal companion for rainy and windy golf days.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(512,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10114',20000,'Description','','The Nike Umbrella Windproof VII in sporty design is the ideal companion for rainy and windy golfing. The screen is easy to open and close and has an ergonomically shaped handle that is comfortable to hold. The screen is 160 cm wide and is printed with two large Nike logos. Includes protective sleeve.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLength of umbrella: 96 cm (37.8 inches)<br />\r\nDiameter of umbrella: 130 cm (51.2 inches)<br />\r\nHandle diameter: 3.5 cm (1.4 inches)<br />\r\nCover: 100% nylon',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(513,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10117',10000,'Head Description','','Large and robust double-layered golf umbrella with large Mizuno logo, graphite shaft and transport sleeve.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(514,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10117',20000,'Description','','Large and robust double-layered golf umbrella with large Mizuno logo, graphite shaft and transport sleeve.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiameter of screen: 145 cm (57.1 inches)<br />\r\nHandle diameter: 4 cm (1.6 inches)<br />\r\nCover: 100% nylon',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(515,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10122',10000,'Head Description','','Breath-active children&#39;s poloshirt with ClimaLite technology. Available in gray and blue.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(516,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10122',20000,'Description','','<ul>\r\n	<li>youth collection 2014</li>\r\n	<li>95% polyester / 5%&nbsp;Elastane with hydrophilic finish</li>\r\n	<li>high-breath-active material - for optimal moisture transport from the skin and rapid evaporation of the moisture</li>\r\n	<li>extremely resistant</li>\r\n	<li>antimicrobial</li>\r\n</ul>