e-Tex technology, durability water resistance&nbsp;and wind resistance combined with optimized breathability. Paclite&reg; product technology is also the ideal solution for golf and leisure activities that require weight and space requirements. A protective layer on the inside of the GORE-TEX&reg; membrane makes a lining superfluous. The result: a small pack size and low weight. The additional stretch fabric is applied to different areas ergonomically to maximize freedom of movement.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(560,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10153',10000,'Head Description','','Excellent heat-insulating properties for autumnal weather conditions!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(561,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10153',20000,'Description','','The <strong>Galvin Green Demi INSULA &trade;</strong> jacket is a soft material with a light and&nbsp;airy material structure to provide lasting protection from all weather conditions. Due to the maximum breathing activity excess moisture is discharged to the outside and ensures an optimal wearing feeling. The additionally integrated air chambers of the fabric store body heat and offer an extremely effective and long-lasting thermal insulation.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(562,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10154',10000,'Head Description','','Tight functional underwear for a lot of movement.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(563,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10154',20000,'Description','','The light and breathable Ladies Pro Crew Long Sleeve by Nike is equipped with the latest Dri-Fit technology. The Dri-FIT fabric removes moisture and provides a dry, comfortable feel. In order to fully develop its function the long-sleeved shirt should be worn directly on the skin or as a second skin.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(564,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10155',10000,'Head Description','','Noble imitation leather belt from Alberto.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(565,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10155',20000,'Description','','Alberto belt as casual belt in classic-elegant black t