ONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10165',10000,'Head Description','','Functional underpants with SKINTIGHT &trade; Compression technology!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(585,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10165',20000,'Description','','The Galvin Green functional underpants also rely on the proven Skintight technology. This is specially designed to achieve exceptional performance in cold weather. The high-tech hollow fibers provide a warming effect, and making the compression 10 material ideal for golfing at temperatures below<br />\r\n122&deg; Fahrenheit. The compression technology stimulates blood circulation and oxygen uptake in the muscles. Improved blood flow and increased endurance can thus arise. Maximum breathability allows the release of excess heat and transports moisture away from the body for dry wearing comfort. Permanent antibacterial technology keeps the garment fresh.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(586,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10166',10000,'Head Description','','The high-tech hollow fibers offer a warming effect!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(587,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10166',20000,'Description','','The SKINTIGHT &trade; Compression 10 Galvin Green Long Sleeve Functional Bottom has the high-performance base layer technology. This is specially designed to achieve exceptional performance in cold weather. The high-tech hollow fibers offer a warming effect, so that the compression 10 material is ideal for golfing at temperatures below 50&deg;&nbsp;Fahrenheit. The compression technology stimulates blood circulation and oxygen uptake in the muscles. Improved blood flow and increased endurance can thus arise. Maximum respiratory activity allows the release of excess heat and&nbsp;transports moisture away from the body and&nbsp;ensuring dry wearing comfort.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(588,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10167',10000,'Head Description','','A light shirt for little heroes on the green!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(589,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10167',20000,'Description','','One-color polo with 2-button strip. Perfect for combining. Light quality. With Adidas logo on the sleeve.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(590,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10168',10000,'Head Description','','Sporty FootJoy polo shirt for children!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(591,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10168',20000,'Description','','The Double Stripe Shirt has a colored strip in the chest area and&nbsp;has a 3-button strip and is embroidered on the collar with the FJ logo. The material fits light and airy and thanks to the stretching part ensures a lot of comfort and freedom of movement.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(592,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10169',10000,'Head Description','','The Footjoy Junior polo shirt is durable and fashionable at the same time!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(593,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10169',20000,'Description','','The Stretch-Pik&eacute;e polo shirt for kids by Footjoy is a high-performance product made of elastic functional material. It is durable and fashionable at the same time. The stretch material supports the movement urge of the small golfers. A fashionable and&nbsp;sporty casual look for children. The polo shirt is blue&nbsp;and white striped. The back is set in the shoulder area with a wide yellow strip.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(594,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10170',10000,'Head Description','','Probably the most athletic among children&#39;s polo shirts!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(595,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10170',20000,'Description','','Sporty and&nbsp;fashionable golf shirt with 3 button panel and pre-made shirt collar. With PUMA logo and a decorative plaid pattern on the chest.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(596,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10171',10000,'Head Description','','The perfect sporty&nbsp;pants for junior golfers at summer!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(597,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10171',20000,'Description','','The Tech Shorts by Puma is the perfect sporty pants for junior golfers at summer. The shorts sits comfortably and offers plenty of movement. The functional DryCell material guides the moisture away quickly to the outside and&nbsp;ensuring a comfortable dry feel. With a UV protection of 50+ the shorts are ideal for sunny golfing. The two spacious side pockets and the two chino-style pockets offer enough storage space. The Puma logo on the left leg was embroidered on the hem and&nbsp;the 18 hole logo was printed above the right pocket.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(598,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10172',10000,'Head Description','','Tight fit without pushing!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(599,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10172',20000,'Description','','UA has developed a ColdGear&reg; long sleeve shirt for young athletes. Because of its fit it is close to the body. The supple outer layer and the warm brushed inner layer offer both soft wearing comfort and an incredible warmth-storing performance.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(600,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10173',10000,'Head Description','','Fashionable polo shirt for fashionable young ladies!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(601,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10173',20000,'Description','','Plain polo with 3-button strip for girls. Polo collar with tone-in-tone abacus logo. The very high quality cotton ensures a comfortable wearing feeling.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(602,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10174',10000,'Head Description','','Sporty skort for junior golfers!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(603,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10174',20000,'Description','','Sporty skort for junior golfers with a nice striped stretch band. The high stretch section ensures maximum comfort and freedom of movement. Two front pockets and two chino pockets to decorate. With&nbsp;set&nbsp;shorts.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(604,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10175',10000,'Head Description','','Classic polo for junior golfers!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(605,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10175',20000,'Description','','Classic functional polo with polo collar and 3-button bar and very short sleeves. The fabric with Dri-Fit function quickly transports moisture away from the body.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(606,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10176',10000,'Head Description','','Safe hold in all living conditions!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(607,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10176',20000,'Description','','The Puma Youth Cuadrado Webbing fabric belt is available in fresh colors and equipped with a shiny metal buckle engraved with the Puma Cat logo. The belt length can be easily and individually cut to the desired length.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(608,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10177',10000,'Head Description','','A lot of freedom of movement and maximum comfort!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(609,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10177',20000,'Description','','The Puma Pounce polo shirt for girls ensures a lot of freedom of movement and a pleasant wearing comfort. The polo shirt is figurnah cut and&nbsp;has a classic collar and two buttons. The mesh material at the back and the Coolmax Extreme technology combined with DryCell technology ensure optimal moisture management and a dry feel.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(610,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10178',10000,'Head Description','','Sporty summer look for success!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(611,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10178',20000,'Description','','This skort provides a sporty summer look and can be combined in a variety of ways. Thanks to dryCELL technology the material ensures maximum breathability and directs moisture to the outside. In addition the fabric protects against excessive sunshine. With two front pockets and one pocket. Includes shorts.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(613,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10081',20000,'Description','','<strong>Product Information &quot;Wilson ProStaff HDX Junior Set, 5-8 Years&quot;</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nOf course you are&nbsp;a role model&nbsp;for your children not only in daily routine, but also in relation to leisure activities. Who would be surprised if they showed interest in golfing? The new Wilson ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior kit is available for 3 levels of age (5-8 year olds), 8-11 year olds (yellow) and 11-14 year olds (reds). The sets are explicitly adapted to the requirements of young golfers. This can be seen in different sizes and weight according to age classes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe beginner set includes everything the child needs to get starts in&nbsp;the attractive golfing world. All golf clubs are extremely easy to play. There is a carry / stand bag in which your child can accommodate both the set of strikes as well as his clothes and all accessories. Just great!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe powerful ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior beginner set for 5-8-year-olds is suitable for children with a body size of 101-127 cm (40 inches&nbsp;till 50 inches)&nbsp;the set for 8-11-year-olds for children with a body size of 129-142 cm (50.8 inches till 56 inches) and the set for 11-14 -year old for children with a body size of 142-160 cm (56 inches till 63 inches).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll sets are characterized by high-quality workmanship made of high-quality materials. Both the set-up of the racquets and the carry / standbag as well as the characteristics of the individual components are specially adapted to the requirements of young golfers of the respective age groups.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior Fairway 3, which is included in the set for 5-8-year-olds and 8-11-year-olds, is specially adapted to children of the respective body size with its length, shaft hardness and weight. It has the high-quality, light graphite shaft &quot;Junior Flex&quot; and creates fantastic swing speeds so that your child can beat impressive widths with it. The head of the&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;has a very generous Sweetspot, a large hit zone, and allows a comfortable forgiveness. This means that even balls that are not centered will fly extremely far. This gives your child safety during the game. The fairway wood is delivered with a matching beater hood.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Iron 7 is included in the set. Equipped with the graphite shaft &quot;Junior Flex&quot; the shaft shows play-supporting swinging characteristics which generate even more length. Also here the head of the golf club is equipped with a very large Sweetspot and thus with a very comfortable hit zone. With this generous forgiveness your child will be able to do everything right from the start. Targets outside the Sweetspot fly just as far as center-hit balls. The wide sole allows the&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;to slide easily over the green without bouncing. As with the Eisen 5, the deep cavity facilitates ball start with optimized weight positioning and improves the feedback in the moment of the hit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Pitching Wedge also has the light &quot;Junior Flex&quot; graphite shaft. It has a classic wedge design and has an optimized racket head shape, which makes it very easy to play. The&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;head with extended Sweetspot scores like the other clubs with a super-large hit zone. This results in an exclusive fault pardon of error. All hits whether on-center or off-center reach maximum widths. The deeply positioned center of gravity produces extremely steep take-off angles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior Putter with &quot;Junior Flex&quot; graphite shaft completes the set of all entry-level equipment. Its special ergonomic handle supports the right grip attitude of your child right from the start. With a classic blade cuff the putter gives an optimal feeling and guarantees maximum control at the short stroke to the flag. The alignment aid allows an incredibly precise sighting of the hole.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne thing is certain - with this ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior set nothing can go wrong! From the beginning your child will get&nbsp;the highest self confidence when dealing with the new profession and will devote themselves to golfing with great joy and enthusiasm! The ambition is develop quickly as far as possible so that your child can meet you at the top of the circle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContents of the Prostaff&reg; HDX Junior Set 5-8 years (101 cm - 127 cm / 40 inches&nbsp;till 50 inches&nbsp;body size), Blue:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFairway wood 3, with matching racket hood<br />\r\nIron 7<br />\r\nPitching Wedge<br />\r\nputter<br />\r\nStandbag in blue',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(614,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10004',10000,'Professional balls!','','The high-quality Dunlop golf balls provide on the other hand for an enormous distance and on the other hand for a high precision during golfing. Thanks to the &quot;Surlyn core&quot; inside the ball it is possible to perform both longer drives and beats with a lot of feeling. The Dunlop golf balls are suitable for golfers with moderate to fast swing speed\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>New, original packaging</li>\r\n	<li>2-piece golf ball</li>\r\n	<li>Content: 15 golf balls</li>\r\n	<li>Very durable and high quality</li>\r\n	<li>Extreme width and high precision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(615,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10005',10000,'Professional balls!','','The high-quality Dunlop golf balls provide on the other hand for an enormous distance and on the other hand for a high precision during golfing. Thanks to the &quot;Surlyn core&quot; inside the ball it is possible to perform both longer drives and beats with a lot of feeling. The Dunlop golf balls are suitable for golfers with moderate to fast swing speed\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>New, original packaging</li>\r\n	<li>2-piece golf ball</li>\r\n	<li>Content: 15 golf balls</li>\r\n	<li>Very durable and high quality</li>\r\n	<li>Extreme width and high precision</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(616,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10006',10000,'','','The high-quality Dunlop golf balls provide on the other hand for an enormous distance and on the other hand for a high precision during golfing. Thanks to the &quot;Surlyn core&quot; inside the ball it is possible