ou can continue up to 2 racket lengths. </strong>For the first time Callaway has incorporated the 360 Face Cup technology of the fairway woods into the irons.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(621,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10075',20000,'Description','','<strong>Callaway Big Bertha Iron 2015 - Features</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Up to 2 rackets length&nbsp;more</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigher ball speed across the entire face thanks to the 360 Face Cup faceplate technology, which is also found in the Callaway fairway woods. When you hit the golf ball at the Sweetspot it flies faster. And if you do not meet him&nbsp;at the Sweetspot he&#39;s still flying faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Maximum pardon of error</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe flight curve of the ball is higher with the Callaway Big Bertha irons and the ball continues to fly. Through maximum utilization of the high moment of inertia especially through the special Internal Standing Wave technology, the weight has been placed exactly so that you benefit from a deep focus.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>More flexible playing face</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nA more flexible face on the Callaway Big Bertha Irons 2015 allows impacts with significantly higher ball speed. For the&nbsp;pardon of error&nbsp;the ball speed remains high no matter where you hit the ball.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Sophisticated and attractive look</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe sole design leaves no wishes unfulfilled - it is wider in the longer iron and thus increases the self-confidence in the stroke and is smaller with the shorter iron, which you can hit anyway more precisely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(622,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10080',10000,'Head Description','','With <strong>Callaway Big Bertha irons you can continue up to 2 racket lengths</strong>. For the first time Callaway has incorporated the 360 Face Cup technology of the fairway woods into the irons.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(623,'CRO