ics which generate even more length. Also here the head of the golf club is equipped with a very large Sweetspot and thus with a very comfortable hit zone. Your child will be able to do everything right from the start. Targets outside the sweetspot fly just as far as center-hit balls. The wide sole allows the bat to slide easily over the green without bouncing. As with the Eisen 5 the deep cavity facilitates ball start with optimized weight positioning and improves the feedback in the moment of the hit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Pitching Wedge also has the light &quot;Junior Flex&quot; graphite shaft. It has a classic wedge design and has an optimized racket head shape, which makes it very easy to play. The&nbsp;golf club&nbsp;head with extended Sweetspot scores like the other clubs with a super-large hit zone. This results in an exclusive pardon of error. All hits whether on-center or off-center reach maximum widths. The deeply positioned center of gravity produces extremely steep take-off angles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior Putter with &quot;Junior Flex&quot; graphite shaft completes the set of all entry-level equipment. Its special ergonomic handle supports the right grip attitude of your child right from the start. With a classic blade cuff the putter gives an optimal feeling and guarantees maximum control at the short stroke to the flag. The alignment aid allows an incredibly precise sighting of the hole.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne thing is certain - with this ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior set nothing can go wrong! On the contrary from the beginning your child will have the highest degree of self-confidence when dealing with the new profession and will devote himself with great joy and enthusiasm to golfing! The ambition is to develop quickly as far as possible so that your child can meet you at the top of the circle.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContents of the Prostaff&reg; HDX Junior Set 5-8 years (101-127cm / 39.7 inches till 50 inches&nbsp;body size), Blue:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFairway wood 3, with matching racket hood<br />\r\nIron 7<br />\r\nPitching Wedge<br />\r\nputter<br />\r\nStandbag in blue',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(625,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10083',10000,'Description','','<strong>Product Information &quot;Wilson ProStaff HDX Junior Set, Age between 8-11&quot;</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nParents are oft a role model for&nbsp;their children&nbsp;not only in daily routine, but also in terms of hobbies. If you are an enthusiastic golfer it is only a matter of time when your offspring wants to follow in your footsteps. The current Wilson ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior Set for children aged 8-11 years in yellow or a body size of 129-142cm (50.8 inches till 60 inches) is part of the progressive junior set and especially for children of this age group. It includes fairway wood 3, hybrid 5, iron 7, a pitching wedge, a putter and a carry / stand bag in yellow.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor beginners in elite golfing this beginner set includes all the golf clubs your child needs at this age to perform the hole play. All golf clubs are characterized by a very easy playability, which is also intended. If this were not so, your child would lose motivation very quickly. The carry / standbag, which belongs to the set, takes the set of clubs, clothing and all the accessories that belong to the game.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(626,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10084',10000,'Description','','<strong>Product Information &quot;Wilson ProStaff HDX Junior Set, Age between 11-14&quot;</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf your children are interested in your favorite sport at the age of 11-14 years the new ProStaff&reg; HDX Junior Set in Red is the perfect beginner set. Includes a driver, the Hybrid 5, the Iron 5 + 7, the Pitching Wedge, a putter and a carry / standbag in red. The golf clubs are optimally adapted by Wilson&#39;s engineers for children from 11-14 years and 11-14 respectively years. with a body size of 142-160 cm (60&nbsp;inches&nbsp;till 63 inches), which corresponds to this age class.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order for your child to get to know the sport of golf it contains the&nbsp;essential&nbsp;golf&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;that it needs for the hole play. Each individual racket is designed to be play-supporting and therefore easy to play. This is necessary as your child only feels confident from the beginning. In the red carry / standbag not only all golf clubs have space, but also clothing and all other accessories, which are important for the game. Its stable stand system with fold-out metal legs ensures a tilt-resistant stand on&nbsp;every surface.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(627,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10085',10000,'Head Description','','With <strong>Callaway Big Bertha irons </strong>you can continue up to 2 racket lengths. For the first time Callaway has incorporated the 360 Face Cup technology of the fairway woods into the irons.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(628,'CRONUS AG','B2C-DEMO','ENU','B2C-10085',20000,'Description','','<strong>Callaway Big Bertha Iron 2015 - Features</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Up to 2 rackets lenght more</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nHigher ball speed across the entire face thanks to the 360 ​​Face Cup faceplate technology, which is also found in the Callaway fairway woods. When you hit the golf ball at the Sweetspot it flies faster. And if you do not&nbsp;hit him in the Sweetspot he&#39;s still fly faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Maximum pardon of error</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe flight curve of the ball is higher with the Callaway Big Bertha irons and the ball continues to fly. Through maximum utilization of the high moment of inertia especially through the special Internal Standing Wave technology, the weight has been placed exactly so that you benefit from a deep focus.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>More flexible playing face</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nA more flexible face on the Callaway Big Bertha Irons 2015 allows impacts with significantly higher ball speed. The ball speed is high no matter where you hit the ball.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Sophisticated and attractive look</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe sole design leaves no wishes unfulfilled - it is wider in the longer iron and thus increases the self-confidence in the stroke and is smaller with the shorter iron, which you can hit anyway more precisely.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(629,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','DEU','B2B-10000',30000,'','','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(630,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10000',10000,'Head Description','','White, light and impressive: <strong>Elan Deluxe </strong>with its aluminum frame in GOR form as a shapely tour companion. An all-round trekking machine with lockable magnesium suspension fork, 27-gear chain gearshift, hydraulic disc brakes and AXA-Lighting test-winner. Really practical: Blendr stem for mobile data communication and Schwalben tires with Puncture Protection puncture protection. Fun on all tours with this trekking bike!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(631,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10000',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Suspension Fork:</strong><br />\r\n	The wheel has a RST Vita Magenisum fork lockable with 50 millimeter&nbsp;(1.97 inches) spring travel and steel spring. So that it stays comfortable on uneven ground.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Gear Changing / Gear Shift:</strong><br />\r\n	At the Diamant Elan Deluxe 2017 the Shimano Deore&nbsp;gear changing&nbsp;/ gear shift takes its place. One of the most advanced and practically developed circuitry Shimano has ever manufactured. With its 27 gears almost every path can be climbed.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Brakes:</strong><br />\r\n	Proven Shimano quality: with the hydraulic Shimano M315 disc brake you can stand up well.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong><br />\r\n	A sporty and&nbsp;trapezoidal aluminum trekking frame with a disc brake mount and pulls inside. Further highlight: Duotrap S prepared for attaching a speed or cadence sensor. (Optional)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Collar:</strong><br />\r\n	The Schwalbe Road Cruiser Light with Puncture Protection will not disappoint you. A further plus of safety is the reflective strip, which also quickly attracts you in the dark.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(632,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10004',10000,'Head Description','','The cycling classic &quot;Eschborn-Frankfurt&quot; has always been on the 1st of May since 1962. From the 6-year-old to the senior, from the beginner to the world-class cycling - all are on the 1st of May with the new collection one of the 4 races of the &quot;&Scaron;KODA Velotour&quot; competition.<br />\r\nThe jersey is based on Bioracer&#39;s highly competitive shirt Race Proven. The aerodynamic and tight fit are its most important characteristics, which make it so popular with road cyclists. The ingenious fit, aerodynamically shaped sleeves and comfort are extremely important in this category. Thanks to its excellent breathability this summer t-shirt is particularly fast drying with UV protection. It has three back pockets and a long secured zipper.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(633,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10004',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	100 % polyester.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Our model is about 185 centimeters (about 73 inches)&nbsp;tall and wears size M. We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(634,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10005',10000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Laser cut inserts on the back.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Breathable fabric inserts on the side.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Our model is about 185 centimeters (72.8 inches)&nbsp;tall and wears size M. Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(635,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10005',20000,'Head Description','','Look, comfort and performance the WLS Black Zero Jersey has it all. The waistband with silicone keeps it in place the parts cut with the laser provide a body-like and aerodynamic cut and the triple pocket provides plenty of space. It was thought of everything so you can only go cycling.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(636,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10006',10000,'Head Description','','The comfortable cycling jersey has all the indispensable details for an extended tour without restricting freedom of movement.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(637,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10006',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Particularly&nbsp;cuddly material in cotton optics.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(638,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10011',10000,'Head Description','','The Endura MTR II baggy shorts are made of very light and robust 4-way stretch fabric. The back is made of nylon and DWR for effective splash protection. The mesh inserts and the perforation support a permanent cooling.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(639,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10011',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Very light and sturdy 4-way stretch fabric anti-slip silicone print in the waistband inside.<br />\r\n	Mesh inserts and perforation support a permanent ventilation.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Click fast compatible.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(640,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10012',10000,'Head Description','','Compact and waterproof. The ideal companion for the road.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(641,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10012',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	2,5-layer cloth.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>SIze:</strong><br />\r\n	Our model is about 185 centimeters (72.8 inches)&nbsp;tall and wears size M. Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(642,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10013',10000,'Head Description','','Performance on professional level perfect for club and leisure drivers.<br />\r\nWith special SPD-SL system. SPD-SL is the further development of the SPD system specially designed for racing. This pedal platform is a seamless interface between the pedal and the shoe plate, which results more effective transmission of force under the extreme pedal loads which occur during competitive conditions. A wide construction of the cleats ensures stability during pedaling and walking.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(643,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10013',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Sturdy, stretchy synthetic leather and mesh.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Precisely adjustable ratchet closure and two asymmetric hook and loop fasteners.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(644,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10014',10000,'Head Description','','Shimanos SH-M200G are durable and resistant shoes that have been specially designed for enduro drivers.<br />\r\nMany bikers look for the connection of perfect fit and comfort. The foot should be held precisely without the shoe being too tight or pressed.&nbsp;You will find exactly this combination with Shimanos SH-M200G. They offer exact control with maximum stability. They are the ideal companions when you are a master of altitude. The special feature: a mesh fabric of several layers regulates the moisture. This keeps your foot dry even after longer stretches.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(645,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10014',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Flat, reinforced protectors for excellent protection and excellent durability.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(646,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10015',10000,'Head Description','','The SuperGel XC is the ideal companion for long training sessions or marathons. This gloves with an elaborate 4 millimeters (0.16 inches)&nbsp;DoctorGel upholstery and made from the highest quality materials protects you not only perfectly against the &quot;falling asleep&quot; of the hands, but also allows you to operate your smartphone. The fingertips are equipped with a touch screen-capable material. Ideal for marathons and frequenters.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(647,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10015',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong>&nbsp;<br />\r\n	Synthetic leather on the inside.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	gMagnets hold the gloves together.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(648,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10016',10000,'Head Description','','The ProGel Woman convinces with the greatest possible wearing comfort: thanks to its super-light elastic material it guarantees maximum freedom of movement and optimal wearing comfort. The 4 millimeters (0.16 inches)&nbsp;thick DoctorGel padding will inspire cyclists who need both comfort and control.<br />\r\nThe women&#39;s model of the most popular GripGrab gloves has a special narrower cut, which provides a better fit for women&#39;s hands.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(649,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10016',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Revolution Lycra.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	gMagnets hold the gloves together.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(650,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10017',10000,'Head Description','','Road bike short gloves with Lycra backhand and mesh inserts for optimal breathing activity and easy cleaning.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(651,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10017',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Lycra Backhand.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(652,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10018',10000,'Head Description','','Finger gloves that is insulated by a Teflon-treated, water-repellent Thermolite material and provides the best weather protection.<br />\r\nIdeal for use in cold weather. Thermolite uses fibers that are hollow inside to create an insulating layer of warm air. The result is a light and&nbsp;warm&nbsp;cloth with outstanding transport characteristics for water vapor, which is not difficult even in wet conditions. The Thermolite developed by Endura also benefits from a durable and&nbsp;water-repellent&nbsp;teflon conditioning&nbsp;(from Dupont).',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(653,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10018',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Narrow-cut cuffs fit into narrow jacket sleeves.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(654,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10019',10000,'Head Description','','The off-road racing shoes for comfort and maximum off-road performance with the patented BOA closure.<br />\r\nBOA locks provide&nbsp;accurate to the millimeter vernier&nbsp;adjustment for a precise fit. Quick release,&nbsp;one-handed and adjustment&nbsp;secure closure and quick release. Fend&nbsp;mud and water off&nbsp;and are extremely light.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(655,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10019',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	High density synthetic leather with ventilation perforation for an optimal fit.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(656,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10020',10000,'Head Description','','The result of the collaboration of Shimano and Michelin: This new sole is characterized by a rubber sole with two density zones and a strategic knuckle pattern for better grip without compromising the pedaling efficiency.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(657,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10020',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Reflectors on the sides or back guarantee good perceptibility.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Fleece insole for extra insulation and heat storage.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Straight cut for normal freedom of movement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(658,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10021',10000,'Head Description','','High performance short-sleeved shirt made of elastic functional material combined with mesh inserts for optimum ventilation. The sporty slim fit ensures an optimal grip. The functional shirt is equipped with a short front zipper. Waistband with elastic band prevents unpleasant slipping of the jersey. The 3-piece and open back pocket offers great storage space. Protective&#39;s sporty, tight-fitting short-sleeved jersey is functional, high-quality, breathable and perfect for race and training applications.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(659,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10021',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Elastic functional material combined with mesh inserts.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	The waistband with elastic band prevents unpleasant slipping.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(660,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10022',10000,'Head Description','','The cycling classic &quot;Eschborn-Frankfurt&quot; has always been on the 1st of May since 1962. From the 6-year-old to the senior, from the beginner to the world-class cycling - all are on the 1st of May with the new collection one of the 4 races of the &quot;&Scaron;KODA Velotour&quot; competition.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(661,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10022',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	The size is smaller. We recommend to order this one size larger.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(662,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10023',10000,'Head Description','','The long ladies&#39; trousers by Axanat are a warmth and comfort guarantor for colder days, because the material with high spandex content is not only free of movement and fit is very advantageous but cuddly on the inside. The hydrophilic equipment keeps unpleasant moisture from the outside and the windstop cover reliably kills the cold attack of the driving force. The rubberized hem ensures a perfect, slip-free seat increases the functionality. The discreet but reflective logo print on the front increases visibility in the dark season.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(663,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10023',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Material:</strong><br />\r\n	Furred fleece inside provides heat hydrophilic equipment.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Product is bigger, we recommend to order one size smaller.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(664,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10024',10000,'Head Description','','The&nbsp;three-fourths version of the Ladies Bike Shorts has an optimal fit and freedom of movement due to the high elastane content. It is the ideal solution for cooler days or for those who do not want to show so much naked legs. Flat-stitched seams prevent pressure points and ensure comfortable wearing comfort. The specific cushioning in the crotch area and the rubberized hem for a perfect slip-free seat increase the functionality. The reflective logo print on the front pants increases visibility in the dark.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(665,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10024',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Highlight:</strong><br />\r\n	Very soft handle.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Size:</strong><br />\r\n	Size is normal.</li>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Cut:</strong><br />\r\n	Close-fitting, athletic fit.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(666,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10025',10000,'Head Description','','For those who want to go high: The M4 from VDO measures the height exactly and constantly displays the current altitude value. The display split into four sections converts the most important bike functions and is illuminated.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(667,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10025',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Clear View:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A lot of function needs a lot of overview and clear structures: The display field has clearly defined areas and&nbsp;space for the output of the respective function values including descriptive fulltext. Efficient layout on illuminated display and a lot of information at a glance.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Height measurement:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to its precise barometric measurement function the VDO M4.1 displays the most important height functions. Starting at the current altitude above the maximum gradient up to the annual altitude meters. In addition the altitude information of each current tour can be called up by pressing&nbsp;the button.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Navigator:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Ripe for the roadbook: The Navigator is a completely independent daytime running counter. Simply define a value from there the VDO M4.1 then counts forward or backward.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Battery Warning:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">All models of the M series inform the user consistently about the battery status. As soon as the performance becomes critical, a prominent message about the weak status of the battery will appear in the display. The data and settings are not lost when the battery is replaced, because they are always stored automatically by the device.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Setting Wheel Size via Collar Table:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The tire can be selected from a collar list. This makes the setting considerably easier.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Full Text Display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">User guidance par excellence: All displays of the M series are equipped with a full-text display. Each called function is named exactly and it is easy to orientate which one is currently selected.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Read Back Total Value</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The total values for the driven distance and the driving time are&nbsp;retrieved separately from the data of the current tour.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(668,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10026',10000,'Head Description','','A high-end cycling computer with the wireless connection technology. Thanks to the large display with large, easy-to-read digits and the large-area control button you can navigate through the menu in any situation. With many functions neverthless this computer is designed&nbsp;very compact.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(669,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10026',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Functional diversity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The MICRO is a true multitalent in an extra compact design. It will show you the current speed, the maximum speed, the average speed, the already elapsed time, the distance and the total kilometers.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>The appreciation of the fans:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Micro is CatEye&#39;s most popular wireless computer. In addition to 8 functions and 12 features it provides a manual&nbsp;counter of kilometers&nbsp;reset as well as a bracket that can be attached to both the front and the handlebar. Available in silver and black this is the wireless computer for any driving style!<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Wireless connection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The transmitter and receiver of the MICRO correspond to each other by radio. This saves you annoying cables and gives freedom of movement. The computer can be attached to the stem and handlebar the&nbsp;counter of kilometers&nbsp;is programmable and can be adapted to your bike. An integrated universal mounting and sensor mounting allows you to install a very quick and uncomplicated installation you can start immediately! If the computer is to be used on more than one wheel,&nbsp;you can desposited two tire sizes and their are stored for use.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Operational life of battery:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The built-in sleep mode automatically turns the computer into an energy saving state. This results in unbeatable recharge times and saves you unnecessary load breaks. The device has two CR2032 batteries. The size of the handlebar holder can be adjusted both at the transmitter and the receiver infinitely and allows a firm fit on your bike. Size of the fork holder: 11 - 50 millimeters (0.4 till 2.0 inches).<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Easy usability:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to the large display with large, easy-to-read digits and the large-area control button you can navigate through the menu in&nbsp;each situation. The menu is simple and self explanatory.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(670,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10027',10000,'Head Description','','According to the wishes of the users the Padrone offers, the largest available display of all wheel computers on the market. From downhill MTB riders to far-sighted bikers without glasses the padrone has been created for those who need a huge display and want the easiest operation.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(671,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10027',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Large display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">According to the wishes of the users the Padrone offers the largest available display of all wheel computers on the market. From downhill MTB riders to far-sighted bikers without glasses the padrone has been created for those who need a huge display and want the easiest operation.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Data link function with smartphones:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Download the Cat Eye Cycling App for free, your smartphone in a safe place,&nbsp;e.g. the saddle or in tricot backage, and lets go. In Mirror Mode GPS based driving data, SMS messages, calls and incoming emails are displayed on the Padrone Smart Display. Your smartphone is well protected all the time in the battery-friendly sleep mode.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Functional diverstity without smartphones:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">If you do not want to take your smartphone with you, use the &quot;sensor direct mode&quot; to get and store information about speed, cadence, pulse and force input directly from the Bluetooth&reg; Smart sensors. After driving in any mode the tour data can be seamlessly transferred to CatEyeAtlas &trade;, Strava &trade; and TrainingPeaks &trade;.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Wireless connection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The transmitter and receiver of the computer correspond to each other by radio. This saves you annoying cables and gives freedom of movement. The computer can be attached to the stem and handlebar, the&nbsp;counter of kilometers&nbsp;is programmable and can be adapted to your bike.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Data exchange:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Just connect the device via Bluetooth with&nbsp;your compatible phone or the Mac&reg; or PC and you can already upload activities for example online fitness communities. On a map you can not only see the distance traveled, but also analyze, share, and see more details.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Height determination:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to its precise GPS measurement function the padrone displays the most important height functions. Starting at the current altitude above the maximum gradient up to the annual altitude meters. In addition the altitude information of each current tour can be called up by pressing the button.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(672,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10028',10000,'Head Description','','Newly designed circuits and improved efficiency allow an easier construction and a slimmer design. The more compact overall package offers the great features and functions as well as an even larger display.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(673,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10028',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Easy usability:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">As the name suggests the Strada Smart is the smartest computer ever. Not only does it show the data and functions of the smartphone apps on the display via Bluetooth 4.0 and display incoming calls or messages - this computer also works completely self-sufficient, if the smartphone is not allowed to run while running or strong &quot;mud slaughter&quot;.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Battery protection of your smartphone:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Through the completely independent work the bike computers are the worries about the battery life of the smartphone history and it can be a lot of kilometers unwound and temporarily stored on the Strada Smart.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Diversity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">On this super-small display you will be able to see the extraordinary function diversity individually. Whether you are using optional Bluetooth sensors for pulse, cadence or even performance data, you always want to have the average speed at your fingertips or the high-end data are your focus.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Personal display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">On the personalizable display you determine what is displayed. Thus the functionality of a GPS training computer can be combined with the simple operation and construction of a super-slim Strada wireless computer. Your tours are still on the bike with a touch of Strava.com or even TrainingPeaks.com with CATEYE Cycling App - at the latest you will not miss any detail of the training or the tour. Come into the future - with the Strada Smart!</div>\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(674,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10030',10000,'Head Description','','The new wireless computer CM 4.11 is characterized not only by modern and innovative optics, but also by PC configurability. This means that all cumulated values can be read out from the device.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(675,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10030',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>PC setup:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The new wireless computer CM 4.11 is characterized not only by modern and innovative optics, but also by PC configurability. This means that all cumulated values can be read out from the device.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>The reference to the essentials:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The wireless bike computer is specially designed for cyclists who want to concentrate on the essentials - biking and fun in freedom. The CM 4.11 works fully automatic without keys and shows all necessary data on a clear 3-line display. The menu setting is easy via 2 pins on the back of the computer.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Wireless connection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The transmitter and receiver of the computer correspond to each other by radio. This saves you annoying cables and gives freedom of movement. The computer can be attached to the stem and handlebar, counter of kilometers&nbsp;is programmable and can be adapted to your bike.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Overall picture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The CM 4.11 features a large, easy-to-read 3-line display (approx. 10% larger than its previous version), aerodynamic design and scratch-resistant&nbsp;body housing.&nbsp;A twist-click handlebar holder ensures easy handling and quick assembly. Also the battery change can be carried out uncomplicated. The cycling computer has all the usual functions such as a start / stop function, numerous kilometers and speed functions. Additional scope of delivery: Twist-click handlebar holder with sensor, spoke magnet and mounting material.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(676,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10031',10000,'Head Description','','Whether by day or by night this bike computer has all the important functions in view. The large illuminated display shows you all information about speed, distance traveled and travel time.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(677,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10031',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Clear arangement:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Whether by day or by night, this bike computer has all the important functions in view. The large illuminated display shows you all information about speed, distance traveled and travel time.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>The suitability for everyone:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The easy-to-use bike computer is ideal for beginners as well as those bikers who want to concentrate on the essentials.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Operational life of the battery:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The CM 1.09 has an exceptional battery life thanks to its economical operation and slim background control. If you use it regularly you can cycle through it for one year without having to charge the device.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Additional gadgets:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With the CM 1.09 the calorie consumption can be displayed, it has a power-down mode and has a night-light display.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(678,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10032',10000,'Head Description','','The NEW Edge 1000 bike computer with GPS for challenges, online features and navigation. If you want to improve your performance or want to compete with the pros - the Edge 1000 is an all-rounder.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(679,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10032',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Diversity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">If you want to improve your performance or want to compete with the pros - the Edge 1000 is an all-rounder. Use online features, compare with other athletes, and participate in competitions. With Garmin Connect segments each tour becomes a race. Results are displayed in real-time on the edge as well as alarms for the start / end of segment and the leaderboard. The segment function ensures constant motivation and encourages you to become better and better.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Navigation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 1000 also allows for special bike navigation and provides map functions. The pre-installed Garmin cycling map Europe contains OSM data (OpenStreetMap) with routable roads, cycle paths, high-altitude data, points of interests and an address search. Card data are stored directly on the edge - the navigation and performance data are therefore not dependent on the mobile network. Card updates are free, too!<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Routing:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With the RoundTrip Routing feature of the device you can discover even more on the road and off-road. Just enter how far you want to go, and the Edge 1000 calculates up to 3 bike routes. Also new is a route planner, which allows the route creation directly on the Edge 1000. If you want to leave the route or end the tour earlier, the Edge can lead you back to the starting point or directly through the shortest route with turnarounds.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatile display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 1000 has a 3-inch and&nbsp;high-resolution color touch screen, which can be used in portrait and landscape format. (expected to be Q2) A sensor for ambient light automatically adjusts the screen brightness to the varying light conditions to increase readability. Unlike the smartphone the display is optimized for use with gloves and rain. Training pages can be customized with up to 10 data fields and activity profiles allow simple transitions when switching between cycling activities, e.g.&nbsp;road, mountain or tours.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Extended performance analysis:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 1000 is compatible with ANT + sensors, e.g. for speed, cadence and heart rate, as well as compatible scales. It integrates the electronic Shimano Di24 circuit as the first bicycle computer from Garmin. So you can see on the display, which gear is just inserted! The Edge 1000 is also compatible with ANT + power meters such as the Vector, the unique Wattmess pedal system that measures the total power, left / right force distribution, and cadence.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Smartphone connectivity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">When you connect the Edge 1000 to your smartphone and the Garmin Connect mobile app you get a variety of online features, including live tracking, incoming call and SMS alerts, social media sharing, weather data and wireless upload features. You can send and receive routes and segments, too. After completion of the tour the data can be automatically sent to Garmin Connect via Bluetooth or WLAN. So you stay connected and share all the details of your tour with friends, family and social media contacts. Via LiveTracking they can also track competitions and training activities in real-time.<br />\r\nUse online features, compare with other athletes and participate in competitions. With Garmin Connect segments each tour becomes a race. Results are displayed in real-time on the edge as well as alarms for the start / end of segment and the leaderboard. The segment function ensures constant motivation and encourages you to become better and better.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(680,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10033',10000,'Head Description','','The Edge 25 stores important statistics of your bike training such as time, distance, speed, overall climb and position. When you connect it to a heart rate chest belt you even get data on your heart rate and heart rate ranges.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(681,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10033',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>The compact function diversity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 25 stores important statistics of your bike training such as time, distance, speed, overall climb and position. When you connect it to a heart rate chest strap you will even get data on your heart rate and heart rate ranges. This is how you know exactly when you have reached your goal. Thanks to the compatibility with the heart rate sensor the data on calorie consumption are also more precise during training.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Track-Navigation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Choose a route completed by other drivers or create your own route at Garmin Connect, our free online training platform. After you have decided on a route transfer it directly to the Edge 25 and follow it to the desired destination. You can even compete against yourself to make the training more interesting.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Additional possibility</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 25 lets you know how fast and how far you are going. Pair it with ANT + &reg; sensors&sup2; and save your cadence as well as speed and distance during hall training.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Live-Tracking:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">When connected via Bluetooth&reg; friends and family with live tracking will have the opportunity to follow your training in real-time. Load trailers via email or social media to view your live data at Garmin Connect.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Battery life span:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Edge 25 determines how fast and where you have traveled - even in dense forests - via GPS + GLONASS. Unlike a smartphone you can use the Edge 25 for up to 10 hours without worrying about the amount of data used or unloaded.</div>\r\n\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Data exchange:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Simply connect the device via Bluetooth and your compatible phone or the Mac&reg; or PC and you can already upload activities to our free online fitness community Garmin Connect. On a map you can not only see the distance traveled, but also analyze, share, and see more details.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Segment-Function:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Use the segment function (Garmin Connect) to compete against other cyclists and compare your ranking. Alarms on the device for the start and end points of the segment must not be missing, too.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(682,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10034',10000,'Head Description','','With the BC 16.16 most of the time frequenters and commuters are always well informed. The display of the ETA shows the arrival time or the remaining time required as well as the remaining distance. In addition each kilometer traveled is converted into saved fuel.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(683,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10034',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Extended bike function:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The extensive functions of the BC 16.16 are shown clearly and partly graphically on the large DOT matrix display. In addition to the classic bicycle functions the BC 16.16 has the ETA indicator the fuel saving in the STS CAD variant by two cadence functions.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Timer:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The BC 16.16 has an exact timer with which you always have the remaining time to the target in view. The estimated time of arrival (ETA) display of the BC 16.16 calculates for a previously set distance the required travel time and&nbsp;the remaining route or the arrival time. So you always know exactly whether you are&nbsp;in time.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>NFC &amp; SIGMA LINK function:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The BC 14.16 has a built-in NFC chip. Via NFC (Near Field Communication)* the data of a tour can be read directly on the smartphone. Settings on the BC 14.16 can also be made by means of this radio transmission. To do this the user first loads the free SIGMA LINK app on the smartphone. Via the app you can load your training data into the SIGMA DATA CENTER or other training platforms (for example Strava, TrainingPeaks).</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>3-channel wireless transmission:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The tried-and-tested and reliable SIGMA TRANSMISSION SYSTEM (STS) is the digitally encoded transmission system of all transmitter data from speed transmitters cadence transmitters and also pulse transmitters for the high-quality base units and top-of-the-range models. The transmitters collect their sensor data and send them as a digital data packet to the receiver integrated into the computer. In addition the transmitter sends regularly stored test data as data matching. The digital coding of the SIGMA TRANSMISSION SYSTEM includes a falsification of the transmitter data by external interference,&nbsp;e.g. power sources or other transmitters. Interference with SIGMA products, e.g. LED lighting, can be excluded.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Rotatable STS transmitter:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The STS speed transmitter is rotatable and can be aligned even better parallel to the magnet. The battery compartment of the STS speed sensor is located on the outside. This makes the battery easy to change even when mounted.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>&quot;Fuel saving&quot; display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The fuel saving feature shows you how much fuel you would have consumed on the same track with your own car. The average consumption of the vehicle is set in the setting.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>The training statistics for 12 months:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">In addition to the totals BC 16.16 also displays statistics for the last twelve months. With this &quot;Training Daybook&quot; you can compare your activities on a monthly basis.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Power-Save:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">After five minutes of inactivity your device goes into sleep mode and after a further five minutes into power save mode. This reduces the power consumption again and ensures a longer battery life. If the integrated acceleration sensor detects a movement the bicycle computer re-awakes and is immediately ready for use.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Temperature display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The models BC 14.16 / STS / CAD up to the BC 23.16 STS have a temperature display. You will be informed about the current temperature of your environment at any time.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Comparison of speed:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">During the journey a permanent comparison is made between your current and your average speed. This is represented by an arrow tip which points upwards or downwards. When the average speed is approached there is no indication.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Adjustable wheel sizes:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">If you have two wheels in use, two wheel sizes can be set, which are automatically detected (only for STS automatic). For this only the speed transmitter on the second wheel must be switched over and the correct wheel circumference for &quot;wheel 2&quot; on the BC 14.16 must be set.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Integrated memory chip:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to an integrated memory chip in the computer head all the settings and settings are stored permanently in the device. So you only have to change the time after a battery change.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Reminder function of bicycle inspection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to the service interval you are reminded of the inspection of your bike at a selectable mileage. The service interval can only be switched on or off by the dealer. The dealer can set the desired mileage using the UNIVERSAL FAST SETTING BOX. In the delivery state the service interval is switched off.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Large display:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The design of the TOPLINE 2016 is vertically oriented and optimizes the&nbsp;slim design with&nbsp;the stem. The new form provides improved display capabilities of the functions. Thus, e.g. the speed at the BC 14.16 is large and permanently visible in the three-line display.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Animated menu:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Small graphics&nbsp;make orientation in the BC 14.16 menu easier. They show training graphics in the area of the profile and setting menus. A scroll bar indicates where you are.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(684,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10035',10000,'Head Description','','The JOCKEY COMFORT is fully adjustable for the perfect fit and ultimate comfort. The adjustable head, back and footrest together with the extended safety features ensure a problem-free ride for the child and parents.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(685,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10035',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Easy installation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The sturdy spring steel bracket makes it easy to mount the child seat behind the driver, regardless of whether a luggage carrier is available or not.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>All-around suitability:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The JOCKEY is suitable for touring as well as sports bikes. The bracket offers enough play so that the seat can be attached to wheel sizes of 26 inches and 28 inches.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Comfort belt:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a clever-clever system the belt provides both maximum safety and the best possible comfort for your rider. In addition the belt can be operated with one hand by means of a plug-in lock.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Adjustable seat:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The backrest of the JOCKEY can be adjusted with just one handgrip. The headrest can also be easily adjusted. The choice of 9 stages is possible, which allows an optimal adjustment!</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(686,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10036',10000,'Head Description','','With the Hamax Kiss biking with your child is easy, safer and more comfortable. Thanks to the free-suspension Hamax mount your child&#39;s spine is also protected on uneven ground.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(687,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10036',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Easy safequard:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a additional chest&nbsp;buckle it is possible to fix the child with one hand and to hold the bicycle with the other hand. The chest buckle avoids problems with the helmet when the child is placed on the seat or lowered. The bicycle saddle seat is easy to mount and dismount. With an additional bracket you can comfortably place the child seat from one bicycle to another bike.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Possible setup:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">All Hamax child seats for bicycles are designed to &quot;grow&quot; with the child; an adjustable safety belt and footrests are included. Hamax recommends that the child should always wear a helmet when using a bicycle pedestal seat.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Natural spring system:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With the Smiley cycling is easy and safe when you take a child on a bicycle. The free suspension Hamax mounting bracket allows a natural suspension and protects the spine of the child during the trip.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(688,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10037',10000,'Head Description','','The new LIGHTSTER USB was designed for daily use in road traffic. High safety combined with easy operation and USB charging option ensures optimal everyday compatibility, which is what distinguishes the LIGHTSTER USB.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(689,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10037',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>USB loading option:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to the integrated USB port the NUGGET can be conveniently charged using the included cable. You do not need any batteries to use the lamps, the batteries have a running time of 7 hours in standard mode.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Luminosity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The NUGGET guarantees a very high safety factor in road traffic thanks to the 0.5 watt high power LED and a side visibility well beyond 220 degrees. A balanced, powerful light image and a good visibility of up to 400 meters (249 inches)&nbsp;are given.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The new SIGMA LED light NUGGET is designed for flexible and&nbsp;daily use in road traffic. It stands for high security combined with easy operation and USB charging option for optimal everyday compatibility.&nbsp;Perfect and without restriction suitable for all bikes or thanks to clip holder even when hiking, jogging and more.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Compact design:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">NUGGET has a weight of 90g (0.2 pounds) (front) and 24g (0.05 pounds)&nbsp;(back). Both&nbsp;lights are surrounded by a water-protected housing. Installation is easy and without tools and&nbsp;the headlamp has three lighting levels.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(690,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10038',10000,'Head Description','','<div>Small, powerful and visually elegant the super-light GVolt25 presents itself. With more than 25 lux and a distinctive lighting of the direct environment he convinces in all matters. Headlights and taillights have a USB port for quick and uncomplicated charging.</div>\r\n',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(691,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10038',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>USB charging option:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Thanks to the integrated USB connection GVOLT can be easily charged using the included cable. You do not need any batteries to use the lamps the batteries have a running time of 7 hours in standard mode.</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Light intensity:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The small, sleek and all-finest GVOLT 25 super sports car brightens the pavement with 25 lux and large-area edge illumination. Two light levels and USB charging complete the concept and guarantee safety even in the evening hours and at night.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">GVOLT is designed for flexible and&nbsp;daily use in road traffic. It stands for high security combined with easy operation and USB charging option for optimal everyday compatibility. Ideal and without restriction suitable for all bikes or thanks to clip holder even when hiking, jogging and more.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(692,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10039',10000,'Head Description','','The mountainbike version of the selling RaceRocket series. Aluminum body with rubberized comfort handle. Due to the increased cylinder diameter more air per stroke is pressed into the tire. With patented SmartHead rotating head for Presta and Schrader valves.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(693,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10039',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Compact design:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Small and compact this pump is easy to stow away and is perfect for on the go. So the lightweight (114g / 0.25 pounds) can be easily stored in the backpack or attached to the bike frame. Thanks to the space-saving rotating handle the valve tube can be sunk into the pump.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Two different valve outlets allow each bike to be floated again with this pump. Regardless of whether it is a Presta or Schrader valve turn around in a twist.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Use in the professional area:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Many professionals use this model, because their high perfomance, their reliability and the space-saving design.</div>\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(694,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10040',10000,'Head Description','','The SKS racing compressor is the rebirth of a legend. The racing compressor has been the most popular pump in international cycling for almost 40 years and is the only legitimate father of all stand compressors.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(695,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10040',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Guaranteeing:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The SKS quality guarantee grants a quality guarantee on products for products&nbsp;with a period of 5 years from the date of purchase. SKS products are appreciated worldwide for their high quality and longevity. SKS guarantees the availability of spare and wear parts.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Two different valve outlets allow each bike to be floated again with this pump. Regardless of whether it is a Presta or Schrader valve and&nbsp;turn around in a twist.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Great power:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The SKS Rennkompressor is perfect for your home. Due to the large lever and high possible pressures (16 bar), fast and uncomplicated inflating of your bike is guaranteed.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Pressure gauge:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">An integrated manometer continually shows the current tire pressure, which allows accurate metering and adaptation to different subsoils.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(696,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10041',10000,'Head Description','','Trelock spiral locks offer a good protection against casual thieves in compact form. They are well suited for the short city tour and are characterized by a light and space-saving construction. The locks are tested and subjected to expert safety tests.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(697,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10041',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>PLC closing cylinders:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Only the original sets standards for the highest precision: PLC locking cylinders from TRELOCK with antipick pin or disc cylinder with antipick and drill protection are characterized by the highest quality and offer security against manipulation attempts.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Compact protection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Trelock spiral locks offer a good protection against casual thieves in compact form. This makes them easy to store, whether in the backpack or directly on the bike.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Combination lock:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The annoying key search is over! With the Trelock SK 205 you can easily unlock a four-digit number code.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(698,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10042',10000,'Head Description','','The ABUS Catena 685/75 padlock is an inexpensive bicycle lock from the ABUS security team. With a 75 centimeters (29.5 inches) chain of hardened steel the&nbsp;padlock is ideal for securing your bike to nearly every wheel stand and&nbsp;making the long fingers difficult.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(699,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10042',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Padlock combo:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The padlock combination is an excellent choice for securing bicycles. Due to its flexibility the&nbsp;padlock offers a high degree of comfort and many possibilities to connect bicycles to solid objects. The lock has safety level 6 and thus offers high security with low risk of theft.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Protective textile hose:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The 6 millimeters (0.23 inches)&nbsp;thick square chain is wrapped with a textile hose for the protection against corrosion and damage to paint damage. This can also be ordered in various colors.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Compact protection:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Trelock spiral locks offer a good protection against casual thieves in compact form. This makes them easy to store, whether in the backpack or directly on the seatpost tube of your bike.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(700,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10043',10000,'Head Description','','The lightweight and compact foot pump from Red Cycling Products with large display for easy reading. With fold-out bracket for a secure stand and flexible hose the bicycle repair becomes a children&#39;s play! Thanks to its compact dimensions it fits in every backpack and is therefore perfect for on the go.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(701,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10043',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Versatility:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Two different valve outlets allow each bike to be floated again with this pump. Regardless of whether it is a Presta or Schrader valve and&nbsp;turn around in a twist.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Comfortable inflation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Bye backache, the Red Cycling pump can be operated comfortably with the foot. The innovative piston construction allows easy-going vertical stroke and ensures optimal power transmission.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Pressure gauge:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">An integrated manometer continually shows the current tire pressure, which allows accurate metering and adaptation to different subsoils.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(702,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10045',10000,'Head Description','','You are ready to tackle adverse conditions anyway.<br />\r\nThe legs burn and the lung scream in the cold air. FOCUS will give you the perfect companion when it gets dirty. So light that shoulders is not a problem. So fast, that also the professionals put on it. So robust that you do not lose time. The MARES have a tradition of 25 years of cyclocross. You are ready.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(703,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10045',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Benchmark:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Years of feedback from numerous professional drivers have made MARES what it is: the cyclocross reference.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Change of a wheel:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Easier and faster: Thanks to the patented FOCUS R.A.T. axle the wheel change takes less than ten seconds.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Thoughtful little things:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Little things often&nbsp;decide about victory and defeat. The specially developed FOCUS CX Chainguide prevents the chain from falling down.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(704,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10046',10000,'Head Description','','Comfort and sporty handling are completely redefined by Attain Pro. Cube has built this road bike so that you do not have to be a professional to get the most out of it. From long trips to short sprints everything is possible. And every meter is a pleasure.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(705,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10046',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Attain Pro has a Superlite aluminum frame whose pipes have been carefully assembled using the Cubes Smooth Welding process. The&nbsp;body rear end&nbsp;is extremely comfortable, because Cube has given it more vertical flex. Shocks are thereby dampened and not transmitted directly to the driver. In addition Cube has modified the carbon cable so that it can now accommodate tires up to 28 millimeters (1.1 inches) in width, just like the frame. The conical control tube and the PressFit bottom bracket housing are connected to one another via the stiff, costly-shaped lower sub-tube. This increases the stiffness, steering precision and efficiency of the landing gear - the result: even more speed.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Attain Pro fulfills its claim as an incomparable fitness and training wheel completely, because Cube has no compromises in the equipment, too. The Sora complete set of Shimano with 18&nbsp;gears and braking system is a guarantee for precise gear changes, reliable deceleration and long-term performance. The 50/34 compact crank drives the rear wheel over the cassette with 11-32 teeth. High quality Cube RA 0.8 AeroDisc wheels with Ultra Sport 2 racing tires from Continental ensure a great grip and low rolling resistance.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(706,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10047',10000,'Head Description','','Real freedom has a name: Nutrail! A bike that goes far beyond the end of the road, where others have to return long ago. The Nutrail is not only a trendy Fatbike, but a real CUBE bike with many thoughtful details. It is designed to conquer not only winter trails, but also to make fun on normal trails. The high-quality and reliable equipment with a Rock Shox Bluto suspension fork ensures unadulterated driving pleasure - from the Sahara to Alaska and, of course, on your hometrails.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(707,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10047',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A Fatbike is not just a bike with extra wide tires. Other rules apply here. For this reason Cube has designed a special frame with special geometry and special details for the new Nutrail. The frame is extremely light with a 3-fold and&nbsp;high-performance aluminum tube set (HPA). With the conical steering tube the extra-wide PressFit bottom bracket housing and the 197 millimeters (7.76 inches)&nbsp;axle at the rear, the frame has a first-class stiffness. Thus the Nutrail meets all requirements for a versatile and fully-traced Fatbike. At the cutting edge of the current standards the Nutrail comes with a pull-over for Sideswing E-Type derailleurs and&nbsp;a replaceable ducting eye and is already prepared for the installation of internally controlled dropper supports.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Rock Shox Bluto RL suspension fork specially designed for Fatbikes and the special&nbsp;11.2 centimeters&nbsp;(4.4 inches)&nbsp;wide swallow Jumbo Jim tire are surely two of the most important equipment highlights of the Nutrail, which makes it possible to bother carelessly throughout the winter, but also to sweep over summery trails. The 80 millimeters (3.15 inches) wide Answer FAT Atac wheels give the Schwalbe Jumbo Jims in&nbsp;11.2 centimeters (4.4 inches) width optimal grip and a perfect shape. Handlebars, stem and seat post are also from the CUBE range. The 2x10 Shimano Deore / XT drive was combined with a Race Face Ride crank with 36x22T. The Magura MT2 hydraulic disc brakes perfectly retard even under the most adverse conditions.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(708,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10048',10000,'Head Description','','With the Access WLS Hybrid Pro you can enjoy the feeling of a true mountain bike and&nbsp;combined with the unbearable mobility that only an E-MTB can offer. Optimized for the ergonomics of women you are sporty and relaxed on the road. Thanks to the reliability of the Bosch drive as well as the sporty equipment, one can enjoy the nature to the fullest. Available in sizes 35.5 centimeters (14 inches) and 40.6 centimeters (16 inches)&nbsp;in 70 centimeters (27.5 inches) format, as 43.2 centimeters (17 inches)&nbsp;and 48.3 centimeters (19 inches) as 73.7 centimeters (29 inches) format.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(709,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10048',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">At Cube you have been thinking about how a Pedelec frame should look for women and the result is called Access WLS Hybrid. The frame is optimally aligned to the requirements of the Bosch drive, is extremely stiff and nevertheless remains very light thanks to the double-conical aluminum Superlite pipes as well as the elaborate shaping. The Agile Ride geometry, optimized for the respective impeller format, with a short and strongly lowered top tube, gives the Access WLS a sporty handling with a lot of freedom of movement. With the storage points for luggage carriers and the integrated rack mount, the bike is quickly converted to the everyday touring and wheeled bike.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Bosch CX drive with a torque of up to 75 nanometers&nbsp;makes a short process even with the steepest climbs and is definitely one of the strongest and best currently available electric drives. With the standard 400 watt per hour&nbsp;rechargeable battery, even long trips is nothing to prevent. Optionally, Cube also offers the wheel with a 500 watt&nbsp;per hour&nbsp;battery. At the rear, the reliable 10-gear Shimano Deore chain ensures a lot of shifting comfort, while the hydraulic Shimano BR-M315 disc brakes ensure the forward drive even by wet conditions. The Cube Cockpit with Rise Trail Bar handlebar and the women-specific Cube WLS saddle provide the ultimate comfort and a comfortable sitting position, even on long journeys. The rest is done by the comfortable Suntour XCR32 suspension fork with its 100 millimeters (3.94 inches)&nbsp;spring travel.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(710,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10049',10000,'Head Description','','Ortlerbergen Acera Bosch Active 300 8-gear - 28-inch (71.1 centimeters)&nbsp;trekking and city e-bike of the extra class. Consistently high-quality, wheel-specific, thought-through, and always at the same time, the highlight of the Ortler Bergen Acera Bosch 8 is its intelligent new BOSCH Active electric drive.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(711,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10049',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Frame:</strong><br />\r\n	At&nbsp;Ortler you have been thinking about how a Pedelec frame should look for women and the result is called Access WLS Hybrid. The frame is optimally aligned to the requirements of the Bosch drive and&nbsp;is extremely stiff and nevertheless remains very light thanks to the double-conical aluminum superlite pipes as well as the elaborate shaping. The Agile Ride geometry optimized for the respective impeller format with a short and strongly lowered top tube and&nbsp;gives the Access WLS a sporty handling with a lot of freedom of movement. With the storage points for luggage carriers and the integrated rack mount the bike is quickly converted to the everyday touring and wheeled bike.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Fixture:</strong><br />\r\n	The Bosch CX drive with a torque of up to 75 nanometers&nbsp;makes a short process even with the steepest climbs and is definitely one of the strongest and best currently available electric drives. With the standard 400 watt per hour&nbsp;rechargeable battery even long trips is nothing to prevent. Optionally Cube also offers the wheel with a 500 watt per hour&nbsp;battery. At the rear the reliable 10-gear Shimano Deore chain ensures a lot of shifting comfort, while the hydraulic Shimano BR-M315 disc brakes ensure the forward drive even when wet. The Cube Cockpit with Rise Trail Bar handlebar and the women-specific Cube WLS saddle provide the ultimate comfort and a comfortable sitting position even on long journeys. The rest is done by the comfortable Suntour XCR32 suspension fork with its 100 millimeters&nbsp;(3.94 inches)&nbsp;spring travel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(712,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10050',10000,'Head Description','','The new reference for folding locks. High security combined with attractive design. Optical guiding features on the head and swivel joints guarantee easy handling. Ergonomics and the easy-to-close closure make the operation of the lock weighing only 1.1 kilograms (2.42&nbsp;pounds)&nbsp;all-round comfortable.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(713,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10050',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>ARMADON 360&deg; ATTACK PROTECTION:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Trelock protects steel cables or closures with its own technology: the ARMADON 360&ordm; armouring. Specially shaped steel bodies encapsulate Profidieben&#39;s preferred &quot;crimping points&quot;. This is how Trelock offers security against the most intelligent and brutal attempts to break up and also protects the locking cylinder and the locking mechanism.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>High strength TREDUR - steel:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The tried and tested dimension of resistance: TREDUR steel. Hard coat and tough core - this is the strength of Trelock&#39;s hardened steel alloy, which combines the optimum of different types of steel.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>PLC closing cylinders:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Only the original sets the benchmark for the highest precision: PLC lock cylinders from Trelock with antipick pin or disc cylinder with antipick and drill protection are characterized by the highest quality and offer security against manipulation attempts.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(714,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10051',10000,'Head Description','','Cube has designed the CrossHybrid Race Allroad for everyday use, but that does not mean that the&nbsp;driving pleasure&nbsp;is still on the track. Extras such as fenders, light system and side stands allow safe cycling regardless of daytime and weather conditions. The powerful Bosch drive system with 500 watt per hour&nbsp;battery and the sporty alignment of the components, on the other hand, ensure a proper driving pleasure and make this bike the perfect all-rounder for passionate pleasure cyclists, demanding commuters and anyone who wants to escape everyday life into beautiful landscapes.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(715,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10051',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The new cross-hybrid&nbsp;allround frame has been completely redesigned for 2017 and carries a lot of mountain bike genes. The double-skinned aluminum Superlite pipe sets the tapered control tube and the complex motor and battery mount made in the Gravity Casting process can not deny this. These technologies increase the weight stiffness ratio, battery and motor integration, improve efficiency and look, and provide an indescribably safe and comfortable ride. In addition to a side stand the luggage rack can also be installed very easily on the 3D forged multifunctional dropouts.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The highlight of this model is the Bosch CX drive. With an impressive drive output of up to 75 nanometers&nbsp;of torque the system is still the benchmark for other pedelec drives. The battery with 500 watt per hour&nbsp;capacity guarantees an enormous range and allows long trips as well as the daily way to work without the constant view of the remaining range. The wide-band Shimano 11-compartment circuit, with XT rear derailleur and SLX 11-42 cassette, master even steepest climbs. The blockable Suntour NCX D RL air suspension fork also provides comfort and control on bumpy roads. The hydraulic disc brake system BR-M315 from Shimano is responsible for a weather-independent and powerful deceleration. The CrossHybrid Race Allroad has a factory installed Busch &amp; M&uuml;ller LED lighting system with a central power supply, robust SKS guards and a cube side stand for perfect everyday life.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(716,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10052',10000,'Head Description','','More drive, more style and less bric-a-brac. This clear principle is followed by Ortler Detroit. It was a matter of deliberate intention to use the classic garment without overloading the bicycle with susceptible technology.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(717,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10052',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Driving experience:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With the Ortler Detroit they take a comfortable and&nbsp;clear look through every city and everyday life - on the road with the good feeling of having chosen the style and quality. Thanks to Shimano 3-gear hub and a sturdy luggage rack carrier the Ortler Detroit is also a reliable companion for longer journeys.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The Detroit has a complete road traffic act&nbsp;equipment, stable aluminum rims and a maintenance-free cartridge inner bearing. With a powerful V-Brake at the front or the classic rear brake on the rear wheel is braked.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The low entry and the large adjustment range of the handlebar and saddle make drivers between 1.55 meters (1.7 yards) and 1.85 meters (2.0 yards)&nbsp;comfortable with the Ortler Detroit Unisize frame size.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(718,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10053',10000,'Head Description','','With the vinyl&nbsp;you&nbsp;find out&nbsp;the thrill of speed. It is a classic fixed gear wheel. The Cr&egrave;me vinyl wheels have a beautiful steel frame and forks that the cream has built in cooperation with Tange, the legendary pipe manufacturer from Japan.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(719,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10053',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixed-Gear technology:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Drive your vinyl as you want it - either as a fixed gear or build it with freewheel and brakes, which are included in the delivery.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Short lead time:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The bike is delivered ready assembled. Pedals as well as handlebars are not&nbsp;fixed into the final position and attachment. Therefore they must be installed correctly before the first use.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(720,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10054',10000,'Head Description','','With the vinyl&nbsp;you&nbsp;find out&nbsp;the thrill of speed. It is a classic fixed gear wheel. The Cr&egrave;me vinyl wheels have a beautiful steel frame and forks that the cream has built in cooperation with Tange, the legendary pipe manufacturer from Japan.<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(721,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10054',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixed-Gear technology:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Drive your vinyl as you want it - either as a fixed gear or build it with freewheel and brakes, which are included in the delivery.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Short lead time:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The bike is delivered ready assembled. Pedals as well as handlebars are not&nbsp;fixed into the final position and attachment. Therefore they must be installed correctly before the first use.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(722,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10055',10000,'Head Description','','The FIXIE Inc. Peacemaker is your new companion on the way to work, to college or to school. The main focus is on reliable&nbsp;daily performance with a few additional nice-to-have&#39;s: Reliable front disc brake and an ergonomic bullhorn handlebar. It does not take more for a cool commuter.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(723,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10055',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Fixie buildup:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A classic Fixie is also at the same time a piece of freedom, because the renouncement of all unnecessary components makes not only the Fixie free of load. Previous bikers report a completely new and&nbsp;liberating sense of driving the same. Fixies without gera hub are manufactured with fixed gear or with flip-flop hub.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Short preparation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The bike is delivered ready assembled. Pedals as well as handlebars are not&nbsp;fixed into the final position and attachment. Therefore they must be installed correctly before the first use.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(724,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10056',10000,'Head Description','','The backspin has a lot in common with his little brother &quot;Floater&quot; and has a few extra features. The straps allow good contact with the bike so first you can&nbsp;learn the balance and later&nbsp;the Skidden. Short stem and mini riser for a snappy steering behavior and spontaneous moves. Stable thicker tires give good comfort and are insensitive. The perfect bike&nbsp;to make tricks.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(725,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10056',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Fixie buildup:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A classic Fixie is also at the same time a piece of freedom, because the renouncement of all unnecessary components makes not only the Fixie free of load. Previous bikers report a completely new and&nbsp;liberating sense of driving the same. Fixies without gera hub are manufactured with fixed gear or with flip-flop hub.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Short preparation:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The bike is delivered ready assembled. Pedals as well as handlebars are not&nbsp;fixed into the final position and attachment. Therefore they must be installed correctly before the first use.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(726,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10057',10000,'Head Description','','With the vinyl&nbsp;you&nbsp;find out&nbsp;the thrill of speed. It is a classic fixed gear wheel. The Cr&egrave;me vinyl wheels have a beautiful steel frame and forks that the cream has built in cooperation with Tange, the legendary pipe manufacturer from Japan. Drive your vinyl as you want it - either as a fixed gear or as it is built with freewheel and brakes, which are included in the delivery.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(727,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10057',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixed-Gear technology:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Drive your vinyl as you want it - either as a fixed gear or build it with freewheel and brakes, which are included in the delivery.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Short lead time:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The bike is delivered ready assembled. Pedals as well as handlebars are not&nbsp;fixed into the final position and attachment. Therefore they must be installed correctly before the first use.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(728,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10058',10000,'Head Description','','If you love your bike, you push it! With this kit you can&nbsp;repair a flat tire anytime and anywhere.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(729,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10058',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">2 patches&nbsp;size F1, 1 patch&nbsp;size 0, 1 patch&nbsp;size F2, 1 coat patches&nbsp;size F2 blue, 1 vulcanizing liquid (5 gram), 1 sanding pad with special rubber pad, 2 mounting levers plastic black, 1 holefinder, 1 pair of disposable gloves, 1 instruction.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>National saving:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a repair kit you can often&nbsp;use a hose and save cost of a new one.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(730,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10059',10000,'Head Description','','If you love your bike, you push it! With this kit you can&nbsp;repair a flat tire anytime and anywhere.<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(731,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10059',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">6 pieces self-adhesive patches, 1 piece of rough paper and 1 instruction.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>National saving:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a repair kit you can often&nbsp;use a hose and save cost of a new one.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(732,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10060',10000,'Head Description','','If you love your bike, you push it! With this kit you can&nbsp;repair a flat tire anytime and anywhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(733,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10060',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">6x self-adhesive patches and 1x sandpaper.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>National saving:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a repair kit you can often&nbsp;use a hose and save cost of a new one.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(734,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10061',10000,'Head Description','','If you love your bike, you push it! With this kit you can&nbsp;repair a flat tire anytime and anywhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(735,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10061',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Rough paper, 3 patches, vulcanizing fluid, 1 valve insert, 1 valve cap.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>National saving:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">With a repair kit you can often&nbsp;use a hose and save cost of a new one.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(736,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10063',10000,'Head Description','','The Agree C: 62 Pro sets new standards for endurance racing machines. Its combination of dynamic handling and comfort is unmatched. This bike is suitable for high speeds and converts every pedal into direct propulsion. The Agree C: 62 Pro&nbsp;does not&nbsp;look&nbsp;as fast as a professional bike, it also runs so fast.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(737,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10063',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">The high-tech carbon frame of the Agree C: 62 Pro&nbsp;corresponds to&nbsp;the latest status of technology&nbsp;in carbon frame construction. As one can expect from a racing bike of this caliber, all the&nbsp;pulls are in the pipes. This creates a clean look and a longer life. In addition to the conical steering tube, Cube also equipped the C: 62 Pro with an integrated &aelig;rodynamic saddle clamp - perfect appearance and perfect functionality perfectly combined.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Oonly the best technology can be good enough for the Agree C: 62 Pro. This is why the Cosmic Elite wheel set from Mavic also has a 30 millimeters (1.2 inches)&nbsp;high rim profile that offers &aelig;rodynamic advantages. The Selle Italia X1 saddle and the ergonomic Wing Race handlebar make contact with the driver. The Shimano Ultegra complete group is familiar with shifting gear&nbsp;and braking. The 2x11-gear transmission including compact crank with 50/34&nbsp;cogs smoothes the road.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(738,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10064',10000,'Head Description','','With its perfectly tuned chassis, the 27.5 inches (70 centimeters)&nbsp;wheels and the Shimano XT 2x11 complete set the Stereo 140 HPA Race comes as a true all-rounder with a highly praised aluminum chassis Ceremony - the stereo 140 HPA Race can do anything!',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(739,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10064',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Only an aluminum frame with the latest technologies can be called High Performance Aluminum (HPA). The elaborately hydroformed and&nbsp;triple-configured tube set achieves an optimum ratio of weight and stiffness. Other technical features are the conical steering tube, the PressFit bottom bracket housing and the AXH dropouts with the X12 axle. Internal gear shifting adds to the overall design. Cubes Answer on the topic of perfect handling? Agile Trail Geometry (ATG)! The bikes reach their wonderfully playful and&nbsp;confident character. The short seatpipe and deep top tube give the frame an optimal freedom of movement for maximum performance on the trail.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A bike that is designed to be roughly harnessed needs the right equipment. That&#39;s why the race comes from first-class Fox suspension components. For 2017 Cube gives the already grandiose Float DPS damper still the EVOL air chamber, which perfects the spring behavior. Just like the Fox 34 Float Fork at the front he also scores with the new black anodization. The brand-new Shimano XT 2x11 complete set with its accustomed precision switch performance and the wheel size adapted 36x26Z. Crank does not limit the height, too, while the powerful XT brakes devour the depth meters hungry. The dropper saddle support and the Raceface 35 millimeters (1.4 inches)&nbsp;cockpit with its legendary stiffness / weight ratio, which is obligatory on such a bike and&nbsp;clearly indicate that the HPA Race is happy to meet new challenges.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(740,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10065',10000,'Head Description','','Your look stretches over the extent that lies before you. Endless trails, challenging climbs and untouched nature - your impulse, the heart of mountain biking. The All-Mountain JAM supports you on your way to the summit and provides downhill with an extra portion of performance for cheekyly raised mouth angles. For you and your JAM there is no mountain high enough.',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(741,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10065',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','<ul>\r\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Frame:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">Only an aluminum frame&nbsp;with the latest technologies can be called High Performance Aluminum (HPA). The elaborately hydroformed and&nbsp;triple-configured tube set achieves an optimum ratio of weight and stiffness. Other technical features are the conical steering tube, the PressFit bottom bracket housing and the AXH dropouts with the X12 axle. Internal gear shifting adds to the overall design. Cube&#39;s answer on the topic of perfect handling? Agile Trail Geometry (ATG)! The bikes reach their wonderfully playful yet safe character. The short seatpipe and deep top tube give the frame an optimal freedom of movement for maximum performance on the trail.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Fixture:</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; margin-left: 40px;\">A bike that is designed to be roughly harnessed needs the right equipment. That&#39;s why the race comes from first-class Fox suspension components. For 2017 Cube gives the already grandiose Float DPS damper still the EVOL air chamber, which perfects the spring behavior. Just like the Fox 34 Float Fork at the front he also scores with the new black anodization. The brand-new Shimano XT 2x11 complete set with its accustomed precision switch performance and the wheel size adapted 36x26Z. Crank does not limit the height, too, while the powerful XT brakes devour the depth meters hungry. The dropper saddle support required on such a bike and the Raceface 35 millimeters&nbsp;(1.4 inches) cockpit with its remarkable stiffness / weight ratio.</div>\r\n',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(742,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10066',10000,'Head Description','','<strong>The Haibike is a dedicated all-mountain bike, where you can enjoy in almost all sceneries.</strong><br />\r\n<em>Note 1,4 <!-- react-text: 692 -->FOCUS e-Bike Test<!-- /react-text --><!-- react-text: 693 -->, 2016</em><!-- /react-text -->',0,1,0,0,0,0,0,0),(743,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','ENU','B2B-10066',20000,'Especially accentuate are...','','Particularly with eMTBs, fitters or stone chips, which can seriously damage the deep engine, belong to everyday life. That&#39;s why as the world&#39;s first manufacturer we introduced the SkidPlate in 2012, a protective element that effectively protects the engine from below.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Protection from below</strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<!-- react-text: 78 -->We follow the concept of a so-called &quot;victim component&quot;: similar to a helmet, it reduce impacts with help of&nbsp;deforms or destroys that would otherwise damage the much more expensive engine.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0),(744,'CRONUS AG','CRONUS-B2B','DEU','1000',10000,'test','','test',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0);
