rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none;\">AKTIONEN</a></strong></font></td>\r\n			<td style=\"text-align: center;\" width=\"90\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"2\"><strong><a href=\"https://2017.dc-test.de/b2c/de/shop/marken/\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none;\">MARKEN</a></strong></font></td>\r\n			<td width=\"20\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td width=\"20\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td width=\"800\"><br />\r\n			<font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\"><strong>Lieber Kunde,</strong> </font>\r\n			<p><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">hier Ihre neuen Zugangsdaten f&uuml;r den Cronus Golf-Shop:</font></p>\r\n\r\n			<table>\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td height=\"50\" width=\"100\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Login:</font></td>\r\n						<td height=\"50\" width=\"100\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">%login%</font></td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td height=\"50\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Passwort:</font></td>\r\n						<td height=\"50\"><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">%password% </font></td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<p><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Aus Sicherheitsgr&uuml;nden bitten wir Sie, das Passwort nach Ihrer n&auml;chsten Anmeldung zu &auml;ndern.<br />\r\n			<br />\r\n			Viel Spa&szlig; beim Einkaufen! </font></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"3\"><strong>Dein Cronus Golf-Team</strong></font><br />\r\n			&nbsp;</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n&nbsp; <font face=\"Arial,MS Sans Serif\" size=\"2\"> </font>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"background: rgb(153, 193, 55); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr style=\"background: rgb(153, 193, 55); colo